    <node id="&quot;HONEY SUPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Additional hive boxes placed on top of the main hive bodies to provide space for bees to store surplus honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Boxes added to the hive to collect honey, typically available in shallow and mid-depth sizes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Boxes placed on top of a beehive specifically for the collection of surplus honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are additional boxes added to a beehive to provide extra space for bees to store honey beyond the brood area."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are specialized boxes of frames used in beekeeping specifically for bees to store honey for harvesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey supers are specific parts of a beehive used by beekeepers to collect surplus honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Removable boxes used in beekeeping to collect surplus honey, available in shallow, medium, or deep sizes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4f0965a7f888753898bdb3624830c9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a7084302d57591ff02e89969b4c3abd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e066e2a68f225f5ecf3fa2f5d02bd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3025455da6b06dabe347fe4878bb963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a230cf3f43e673f8797237bc5d97548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85263881590bbad34c8bcb9551c9a883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb5ed2e7521db41a82dfc5b79b8b701</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 407}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1556}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMOKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A beekeeping tool constructed from stainless steel used to produce smoke to distract and calm bees or herd them in a specific direction."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used by beekeepers to blow smoke into a hive to calm bees during inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used in beekeeping to calm bees by puffing smoke into the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to blow smoke into a beehive to calm bees during inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to produce smoke to calm bees by masking alarm pheromones, making it safer for the beekeeper to work."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a device used by beekeepers to produce smoke to calm bees during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a piece of beekeeping equipment used to calm bees during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to blow smoke into a hive to calm bees and disrupt their communication during inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to blow smoke into a hive, which calms the bees and announces the beekeeper's presence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to calm bees and can also act as a wedge to prevent supers from collapsing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to calm bees by blowing smoke into the hive before and during inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A smoker is a tool used by beekeepers to calm bees during hive inspections or transport."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to blow smoke on bees to mask alarm pheromones and reduce their defensiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to calm bees during hive inspections and maintenance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An essential beekeeping tool that produces smoke to calm and soothe bees, commonly made from stainless steel, galvanized metal, or tinplate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f11f928b6b6595520556e61b690ad234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6739d4c7c92b4bbf50b18187fe06b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c516e184f72cae24cee188c702d41f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caeb5d2bd49a72e7116025708c05e9f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048ad5fead1e52a66cfd2e40b5467d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c100bb043929fe5d53e4af2e279dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf15980aea2d79d85e102a8e8c947bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91fddbed5da654e2156cc50a2222b4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3025455da6b06dabe347fe4878bb963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3a9f95df2c28cf16cc0339d5b436227&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff7d8f22cb1bb72cdb48f20d4975e8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788901d0b4d29c039e6a86eed1ac4b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-288ac639645002f12344e2dbb4b38cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c85b379d83c9f869435c42e6568dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dee772a46eb60a47d303c4f69578a182</data>
