    <node id="&quot;HIVE TOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A handheld metal tool used by beekeepers to pry apart hive frames and boxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A handheld tool used by beekeepers for prying frames, scraping burr comb, and manipulating hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a basic necessity in beekeeping used for manipulating hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a metal implement used by beekeepers to pry apart hive components and manipulate frames."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a specialized piece of equipment used by beekeepers to pry apart hive boxes and frames."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a specialized piece of equipment used by beekeepers to pry frames and slice through propolis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hive tool is a ten-inch, wedge-like steel implement used by beekeepers to open beehives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A metal tool resembling a minicrowbar used for manipulating hive parts."&lt;SEP&gt;"A metal tool used by beekeepers to pry apart frames and hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A metal tool used by beekeepers to pry apart hive sections and remove frames with minimal damage to the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A metal tool used by beekeepers to pry open packages, move frames, and manage hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized metal tool used by beekeepers to pry apart frames and scrape wax from the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized tool used by beekeepers for prying open hive components or separating frames."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized tool used by beekeepers to separate and slide frames apart within a beehive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to dislodge propolis and manage hive components."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers, which can be used to scrape bee stingers off the skin."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e9de2778ec077dc2aae514901168a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67600081c317292f8ef362e2f5621f34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f928b6b6595520556e61b690ad234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6739d4c7c92b4bbf50b18187fe06b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cdc449839e793310ef8f89b87479c09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c516e184f72cae24cee188c702d41f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048ad5fead1e52a66cfd2e40b5467d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c4a101237a6eb4eff648c0b0b5a16d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c100bb043929fe5d53e4af2e279dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91fddbed5da654e2156cc50a2222b4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3025455da6b06dabe347fe4878bb963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3a9f95df2c28cf16cc0339d5b436227&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-288ac639645002f12344e2dbb4b38cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85263881590bbad34c8bcb9551c9a883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813ff1de343023e85ba7e541c258f8f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50100ec9bbd638fb693fc24eeb2b3110</data>
