    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VEIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A piece of protective beekeeping gear used to shield the face and head from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective face covering used by beekeepers to protect the vulnerable facial area from bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective mesh covering for the head and face used by beekeepers to prevent stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective mesh headgear used by beekeepers to prevent bees from stinging the face and head."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective piece of clothing used in beekeeping to shield the face and neck from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective piece of clothing worn by beekeepers to protect the face and neck from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A veil is a piece of protective clothing worn by beekeepers to protect their face and head from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A veil is a piece of protective gear worn by beekeepers to protect their face and head from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A veil is a protective piece of clothing worn by beekeepers to shield their face and neck from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A veil is standard protective operating equipment worn by beekeepers to protect their face and neck from bee stings during harvest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective gear worn by the beekeeper to protect the face and neck from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective headgear worn by beekeepers to prevent bees from stinging the face and head, available in round and square styles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective headgear worn by beekeepers to prevent bees from stinging the face and neck."</data>
