    <node id="&quot;BEEKEEPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Beekeepers are individuals who manage bee colonies and employ swarm control and prevention techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beekeepers are individuals who manage bee colonies and make decisions regarding requeening, feeding, and hive protection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Humans who manage honey bee colonies, sometimes holding specific views on the utility of drones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals who manage and care for bee colonies, responsible for diagnosing hive health and introducing new queens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals who manage honey bee colonies and implement deterrents to protect their apiaries from wild animals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals who manage honey bee colonies and may develop tolerances or allergies to bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals who manage honey bee colonies, focusing on the care of queens, workers, and drones."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ee196747c63e46006af016f7f2104f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c389aa55b6d5b4c773f2c917b36e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59970fe46f1c3b11508247730ae6145d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bed6fe8d6b1e0689fd3080d94a55bcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b481828497c05f9df552dd81b644f543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efd4ef14d88b08f2fac0f36e6180fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc749ae5b6e2c5fae540d31c52a16691</data>
