    <node id="&quot;AFRICANIZED BEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A crossbreed of African bees (Apis mellifera scutellata) and European honey bees, known for aggressive traits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A species of bee that is a potentially serious threat to humans and is spreading across the country."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific hybrid breed of honey bee introduced to the country, often associated with increased aggressiveness in certain areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific type of honey bee known for increased aggression, whose introduction has led to legal restrictions on picking up swarms in some areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Africanized bee is a type of bee whose spread may lead to further regulations and whose stinging attacks can result in bans of bees from specified areas."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-18646221e86ea90ee41e4d859e5ef7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d621a8bb4b7eb07600bbbfbdafcad0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee734f0540c7fd5dab112e837ae5a36b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f78f364d74eca8b91a5a10f5f9de4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc749ae5b6e2c5fae540d31c52a16691</data>
