      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Western Hemisphere is a geographical region mentioned in the context of where parasitic mites are not native."&lt;SEP&gt;"The half of the earth located west of the Prime Meridian, where the history and work regarding Africanized bees are documented."&lt;SEP&gt;"The region of the Americas where parasitic mites are not native."</data>
