    <node id="&quot;HONEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A natural substance produced by bees containing pollen and vitamins, used as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural substance produced by bees, known for its stability, antibacterial properties, and use as a food product."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural substance produced by bees, used in this context as a remedy for sting pain."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural sweet substance produced by bees, sold by the author and subject to organic management practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural sweet substance produced by bees, sold in various grades (table-grade, lower grades) for retail and wholesale."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural sweetener produced by bees, sold as a primary product in wholesale and retail markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural sweetener produced by bees, used as a benchmark for comparing the saccharide composition of HFCS."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural sweetener produced by bees, used as food and a healing medicine, and sold in various forms such as liquid, crystallized, creamed, comb, chunk, flavored, seasonal, or varietal."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sweet substance produced by bees from nectar, consisting of sugars, water, and enzymes, existing in various varietals."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sweet, viscous material produced by honey bees from processed nectar, composed mainly of glucose and fructose."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is a natural substance produced by bees, used as a primary food store to sustain the colony through winter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is a natural substance produced by bees, used as nourishment for hives and as a commercial product for human consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is a substance produced by bees from nectar, serving as a primary carbohydrate source and energy reserve for the colony."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is a sweet substance produced by honey bees from nectar, noted for its health-promoting properties and ability to heal burns and infections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is a sweet, viscous food substance produced by bees, which can undergo a natural process of granulation or crystallization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is the natural food store produced by bees, essential for the colony's energy and survival during winter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Honey is the primary product being sold by the vendor, available in various jar sizes and forms such as raw unheated honey."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67600081c317292f8ef362e2f5621f34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64bd868f29e83effc96703b72e21cc18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d27522a707cf7ed26c16a5c94c4e6ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed162ca2c3e6139bcf43874c7af906bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b43d31102c54c8a9ea45b442a0a3169b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7bad5a771d728b5a074404c1820fac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da9216023ced68a9aa545d43ca1d419f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83a259bf73a7b34abe03f6e2d50d6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b30dd2b72067de8dc8358baf75e16d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d24243f158f01183a67e8cbfb4f883b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59970fe46f1c3b11508247730ae6145d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfec606648bbeb5ca28bfc5c7e8323a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a6f293580aa424d04ad67558a1427b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-824704426592ed72e9ae44a04bd1ddbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc749ae5b6e2c5fae540d31c52a16691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78d99903600ffa6f92d29953bed6a52</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 404}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 1535}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 2028}]</data>
    </node>
