    <node id="&quot;ROMANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Mediterranean people known for their early flourishing agriculture and later shift toward slave labor and pastoral industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Romans are an ancient people mentioned in the context of the historical timeline of land recreation in England."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Romans were an early civilization that developed some knowledge of beekeeping and bee feeding, though they lacked understanding of hive internal dynamics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-93fd599c3721904b0c0c72f8f1f0969f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7029b183fa2cc4e652b9cb3d96c587ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7197b1327e60ebc0c4ee2f3ed2bd7e13</data>
