      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Middle Ages is a historical period during which protective clothing for beekeepers was first devised."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Middle Ages refers to the historical period characterized by specific husbandry and field systems."</data>
