      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The East Coast is the region where honey bees first arrived in North America around 1628."&lt;SEP&gt;"The eastern region of the US that receives off-season fresh produce from California."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-93fd599c3721904b0c0c72f8f1f0969f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0411bd672adabdde5a4bdf77ebe2d43</data>
