      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A biological technique used by queen breeders to obtain purebred honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A breeding procedure used to maintain stocks of hybrid bees, noted for being expensive in time and money."&lt;SEP&gt;"A laboratory process used by queen breeders to obtain purebred honey bees, though noted to potentially result in more problems than natural mating."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reproductive technology used in cattle breeding that can multiply the defects or qualities transmitted by a bull."&lt;SEP&gt;"Artificial insemination is a livestock breeding technology which the author describes as a monstrous innovation leading to life-erosion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Artificial insemination is a modern practice of animal breeding that the author considers unnatural and subject to future condemnation."</data>
