    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIVE STAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A structure used to keep the hive bottom board off the ground to prevent dampness and rot."&lt;SEP&gt;"A support structure used to elevate a beehive off the ground."</data>
