      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A container, such as a perforated glass jar, used to provide syrup to the bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to provide supplemental food to bees, available in various forms including plastic pails or glass jars."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to provide supplemental nectar or syrup to the bees within the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to provide supplemental syrup or pollen to bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to provide syrup or food to a bee colony, simulating a nectar flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to provide syrup to bees, designed to maintain equilibrium via atmospheric pressure to prevent leaking."</data>
