      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hand protection used in beekeeping to protect the wearer during infuriated bee encounters, though bare-handed work is sometimes preferred for better tactile feel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective handwear used by beekeepers to prevent stings while working with hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective handwear used by beekeepers to shield their hands from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective handwear used to prevent bee stings."</data>
