      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A specific style of beekeeping feeder often included in beginner outfits, typically used with quart jars and placed outside the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Boardman feeder is a specific type of bee feeder located outside the hive, noted for its accessibility and potential to attract robber bees."</data>
