    <node id="&quot;BEE SUIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bee suit is a full-body protective garment worn by beekeepers to prevent bees from stinging them."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bee suit is a piece of protective equipment worn by beekeepers to prevent stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bee suit is a protective garment worn by beekeepers to prevent bees from stinging their skin."&lt;SEP&gt;"A full-body protective garment designed to shield beekeepers from bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective garment designed for beekeepers; the text specifically highlights a three-layer design with nylon mesh to prevent bee stings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective garment used by beekeepers to prevent stings, typically including gloves and a veil."&lt;SEP&gt;"A protective garment worn by beekeepers to prevent bee stings, often including a helmet, veil, and gloves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective clothing designed to protect beekeepers from stings, typically including a veil, gloves, and full-body coverage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protective clothing worn by beekeepers to prevent bee stings while working with a hive."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7f35b518c8481093038a38bf2b64387d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdb2c38da2254d735c78b22dae9b2c6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9fa8be9c480f16c9786fe42c4a409a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d621a8bb4b7eb07600bbbfbdafcad0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b0512dda0784c4b872422e6d8bd9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c100bb043929fe5d53e4af2e279dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf15980aea2d79d85e102a8e8c947bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-288ac639645002f12344e2dbb4b38cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788901d0b4d29c039e6a86eed1ac4b10</data>
