    <node id="&quot;BANANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fruit whose scent is rumored by some beekeepers to resemble the alarm odor of stinging bees, though the author's experience suggests otherwise."&lt;SEP&gt;"The banana is a crop studied at Pusa and St. Vincent, noted for its positive response to farmyard manure and leaf-mould."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7f35b518c8481093038a38bf2b64387d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fd8b3490e045fee1663a444486deee</data>
