    <node id="&quot;QUEEN CAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device made of plastic, wood, or metal used to house and introduce a queen bee into a hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A small box with a screen used for holding and transporting a queen bee."&lt;SEP&gt;"A small container used to house and protect a queen bee during transport or introduction to a colony."&lt;SEP&gt;"A small container used to transport and safely release a queen bee into a hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized container used to hold and protect the queen bee during transport and installation into a hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized device used to introduce a queen bee into a colony slowly to ensure the worker bees accept her."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specialized small container used to securely house and transport the queen bee, featuring a candy-sealed end for delayed release."</data>
