      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Female bees that perform various tasks in the hive, including attending to the queen and foraging."&lt;SEP&gt;"Worker bees are female bees that perform various tasks within the hive, including nursing larvae, foraging for nectar and pollen, and raising a new queen."</data>
