    <node id="&quot;CANDY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A sugar-based food source provided in the queen cage for the queen to eat until she is released."&lt;SEP&gt;"Candy is a concentrated form of granulated sugar and water boiled to the hard ball stage, used as a winter food supplement for bees."</data>
