      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A basic piece of beekeeping equipment used to brush live bees off frames, especially during harvest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A basic piece of beekeeping equipment used to gently brush live bees off of frames, particularly during harvest."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92090c6a7f40e420c9b8e4d961a9a21b</data>
