    <node id="&quot;BEE ESCAPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bee escape is a small one-way door device placed in a hive cover to allow bees to leave the honey super but prevent them from re-entering."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used in beekeeping to allow bees to leave a super while preventing them from returning, facilitating honey removal."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to allow bees to leave a section of the hive while preventing them from returning."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b2fa060b49dfcd9523440966c974ac</data>
