    <node id="&quot;ESCAPE BOARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device, often a simple maze, that provides a one-way passage for bees to exit a super without the use of springs."&lt;SEP&gt;"A flat device used for the one-way passage of bees, primarily to remove bees from honey supers before harvest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A low-impact tool used to aid in removing bees from honey supers during harvesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used by beekeepers to manage bee movement when harvesting honey."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used to clear bees from a specific section of the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"An escape board is a device similar to a bee escape that allows for faster removal of bees from honey supers, typically within 24 to 48 hours."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a44dc74bf3cf27c95be223e2ae38c2f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afb545522a163c5982461b497e852ea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b2fa060b49dfcd9523440966c974ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92090c6a7f40e420c9b8e4d961a9a21b</data>
