    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUME BOARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device used to introduce fumes into the hive to drive bees downward and out of the supers for honey collection."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fume board is a piece of equipment used in beekeeping to manage bees during harvest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used in beekeeping that typically involves a strong-smelling substance to manage bee behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also known as an acid board, this device uses a foul-smelling liquid to drive bees out of a super quickly."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-539e9876329b00dde77700328dfd38d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92090c6a7f40e420c9b8e4d961a9a21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7acff18895bfa08e6388fc660689bad7</data>
