    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLOWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device, often a household leaf blower, used to effectively remove bees from honey supers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A household device, typically used for leaves, that can be effectively used to remove bees from supers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used to clear bees from hive supers using air pressure."</data>
