      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device used to remove honey from combs using centrifugal force, available in various capacities and styles such as tangential and radial."&lt;SEP&gt;"A device used to spin honey out of combs; some beekeepers are developing versions specifically for horizontal combs from TBHs."&lt;SEP&gt;"A piece of equipment that uses centrifugal force to whirl frames and remove honey without destroying the comb."&lt;SEP&gt;"An expensive piece of equipment used by beekeepers to remove honey from combs without destroying them."</data>
