      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A powered version of an uncapping knife used for more efficient removal of wax cappings."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d9fe3ef9f53a3c23c8d05dafdfe1c88f</data>
