    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN FOULBROOD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bacterial disease affecting honey bee brood."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bacterial disease caused by Paenibacillus larvae, resulting in brownish pupal mass, foul-smelling combs, and black scales."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bacterial disease of honey bees that beekeepers treat with antibiotics."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bacterial infection that affects honey bees, previously a major problem for beekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A deadly infectious bacterial disease that kills young bee larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A highly contagious and lethal bacterial disease affecting bee larvae, characterized by a sour stench and stringy yellow larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A highly contagious and serious bacterial disease that affects honey bee larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A highly contagious bacterial disease among honey bee colonies that produces a foul odor and often leads to colony death."&lt;SEP&gt;"A highly contagious honey bee disease caused by spores that infect the larvae, potentially leading to the total collapse of the bee colony."&lt;SEP&gt;"A long-time disease affecting bees for which a cure was found, allowing the industry a period of confidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious bacterial disease affecting honey bee brood."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious bacterial disease of bee larvae, characterized by long ropy threads and a distinctive odor."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious bacterial disease of honey bees that the industry eventually found a cure for."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious bacterial disease of honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious bacterial disease that affects honey bee larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious brood disease caused by spore-forming bacteria that can be deadly to a honey bee colony."&lt;SEP&gt;"A serious microbial disease caused by Paenibacillus larvae that infects bee larvae and can destroy entire apiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"American Foulbrood is a serious bacterial disease affecting honey bee larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"American foulbrood is a notorious honey bee disease characterized by a foul odor, used to contrast with the symptoms of CCD."&lt;SEP&gt;"American foulbrood is a serious bacterial disease of honey bees mentioned as a risk when feeding honey between hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"American foulbrood is a severe bacterial disease that affects honey bee brood, potentially leading to the death of the colony."&lt;SEP&gt;"American foulbrood is a specific honey bee disease that original regulations were designed to control."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b96aee8fce1383e3a88948dc5d0aad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1514064bbd0a8e145cda20ebb9ecab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36349dc9e2604b53b31c0c3d9931128e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71c661e88d96156e87449e9332b56ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53dab54c5e432f26775d35bbbc12efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-850b95b5ab1cf1d4aef287383ef1ecfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f970a1d154acdb2ae156eac6a317018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8745264800edf7a73b7e5b714dc70158&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad59b3ec786d96ceb0cf84e4d5b8446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693ffb57dfcac7260fd0345d7e791e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e823f4271cc674d258a850b82bd8b70b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b56d1daf41a7135af792e5f17f10061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad055bc816d7df3212732523b38332d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d75b31628c95bce2d1de33c7d05683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c4227735c6f952b192f6d769deb712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2dbfbb5c1a5664034bad31b4143c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9eafb5519ae847ebc95f1b6bd7a3901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bab4a72f46eead5c78b6d5b292d2ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4642364014d20a8527d9fb4ec06bdb04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58512ee8d1c43dccf19e6d73e944fd38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fcbe54cf1d72b0c107b42a5d283af2d</data>
