      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An antibiotic (oxytetracycline hydrochloride) specifically labeled and allowed for use in beehives in the United States to prevent and treat American foulbrood."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic drug (oxytetracycline) used to control diseases in honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic used by beekeepers to treat American foulbrood in honey bee hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic used in beekeeping to treat certain diseases or pests."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic used to treat bacterial infections in bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic used to treat certain bee diseases, such as European Foulbrood, though it is not effective against sacbrood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terramycin is an antibiotic used by beekeepers to control foulbrood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Terramycin is an antibiotic used prophylactically in beekeeping to treat or prevent disease in bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial brand name for the antibiotic oxytetracycline used in hives."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a07d3f020711352b6c4bb16ca80f182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066653911102a71446dc7a3246a0c193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60d95d43ba8296324163e2f53c3c2458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d75b31628c95bce2d1de33c7d05683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad055bc816d7df3212732523b38332d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2dbfbb5c1a5664034bad31b4143c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad59b3ec786d96ceb0cf84e4d5b8446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162427b12ed8d1e50c5d8b055e2cd5f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-850b95b5ab1cf1d4aef287383ef1ecfe</data>
