      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A contact miticide available as impregnated plastic strips used to kill tracheal mites in bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A contact miticide containing amitraz, used as impregnated plastic strips to treat both tracheal mites and Varroa mites."&lt;SEP&gt;"Miticur is a brand name for a chemical-impregnated plastic strip containing amitraz, used to control varroa mites in bee hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Miticur is a chemical control product designed to kill varroa mites with a high success rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Miticur is a medication used for treating mites in beehives that does not require warm temperatures to be effective."</data>
