    <node id="&quot;SMALL FARM TODAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bimonthly how-to magazine focused on alternative and traditional crops, livestock, and direct marketing, started in 1984."&lt;SEP&gt;"A magazine authored by the writer, catering to the readership of agripreneurs."&lt;SEP&gt;"A magazine published by the author that serves as a resource for people interested in small-scale farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"A magazine that features contributions from farmers like Steve Salt."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication whose readership consists of farmers, including many who have been farming for less than five years."&lt;SEP&gt;"Small Farm Today is a magazine focused on small-scale farming where Chuck DeCourley previously worked as promotions director."&lt;SEP&gt;"Small Farm Today is a magazine started to provide essential information to small farmers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Small Farm Today is a magazine whose readership requested a book on making small farms profitable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Small Farm Today is an organization that provides guidance and receives calls from farmers regarding marketing and planning."&lt;SEP&gt;"The current name of Ron Macher's magazine, described as the industry bellwether for small farming."</data>
