    <node id="&quot;AGRIPRENEURSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A business-oriented approach to farming where the farmer acts as their own middleman, selling directly to consumers and focusing on strategic planning and sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A concept combining agriculture and entrepreneurship, involving personal qualities and principles for running a farm as a business."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agripreneurship is the application of entrepreneurial principles to the farming industry, involving planning and resource evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agripreneurship is the integration of agriculture and entrepreneurship, treating a farm as a business to achieve profitability and sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agripreneurship is the practice of applying entrepreneurial principles to agriculture for profitability and sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agripreneurship is the practice of applying entrepreneurial principles to agriculture, focusing on risk-taking and price-making to increase profitability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agripreneurship is the practice of applying entrepreneurial principles to farming, emphasizing sustainability and the ability of the farmer to act as their own middleman in the market."&lt;SEP&gt;"The concept of combining agriculture and entrepreneurship to treat a farm as a profitable business."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice of applying entrepreneurial principles to agriculture, focusing on being risk takers and price makers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4725469cd4458c0f5eeeefdfccd30dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e64fb1fe152a62cd06403742bd6beac5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c7079e4e94fbb77a10c466d9f4a5438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef577d840302c2f3d95d7cb5a8f77433&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099841c9e59bebef5ddbb5acdb1e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a464eab8eee71e80f3498a79e8163ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157caea7b572636fefb27a23c9261c73</data>
