    <node id="&quot;HENRY FORD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Henry Ford is a business baron known for developing efficient procedures and mass production in the auto industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Henry Ford is a historical figure quoted regarding the relationship between humans, the land, and insecurity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Henry Ford is an industrialist and inventor who tinkered with carriages and established factories that lured millions of people to cities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Henry Ford is an industrialist and inventor who was tinkering with early automobiles during the transition to the industrial era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Henry Ford is the creator of the Model T and a visionary who envisioned automobiles running on community resources."</data>
