    <node id="&quot;ELECTRICITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A form of energy used for modern heating and power, representing a shift away from ecological dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"A general-use energy source cited as a technological achievement made possible by agricultural surpluses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Electricity is a modern power source that changed how households are heated and powered."&lt;SEP&gt;"Electricity is a power source that was not yet widespread in cities during the era of horse-drawn transport."&lt;SEP&gt;"Electricity is a technological utility that has made farm life easier compared to the past."</data>
