    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUTOMOBILE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The automobile is a transport product that has improved mobility and ease of life in rural environments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The automobile is a transportation technology that enabled rapid movement between urban and rural areas after World War II."</data>
