    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE FARMING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A low-input farming method aimed at direct markets that is environmentally sound, socially acceptable, and economically viable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sustainable farming is a method of agriculture designed to be a continuous cycle that replenishes livestock and crops without wearing out the land or the farmer, prioritizing profitability."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bfed52d46f5bf9d5489c4d6b6dddd2cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 580}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVENTIONAL AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A farming system characterized by high-input practices, such as heavy use of synthetic fertilizers and pesticides, often focusing on monocultures."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of farming that typically relies on synthetic chemical inputs such as nitrogen fertilizers and herbicides."&lt;SEP&gt;"A traditional farming system where farmers raise crops and sell them through middlemen to retailers and consumers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional agriculture is a traditional farming system where farmers raise crops and rely on middlemen and retailers to reach the consumer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional agriculture refers to the industrial farming system characterized by chemical-intensive monocultures and frequent tillage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional agriculture refers to the standard industrial farming method characterized by high chemical inputs and low-diversity crop rotations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conventional agriculture refers to the standard industrial farming system based on tillage and high chemical input."&lt;SEP&gt;"The standard industrial farming system, which has been criticized since the early 1980s as being unsustainable."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff08f7dd7004bc2552c2a3d5b2401a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6efabe1598e6b04e35168d3c337aa67b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28351085b82af5a0f49bb9d74856507b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54338209a610084057de4fde840e5cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1791122186a3d77110cdc1caf21599f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c3d2efe6371d76745273d9d05718619&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157caea7b572636fefb27a23c9261c73</data>
