    <node id="&quot;GREENHOUSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Greenhouses are hoophouses that include supplemental heat to maintain temperatures for plants or animals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greenhouses are structures used for plant propagation, providing warmth and sunshine during winter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greenhouses are structures used to extend the growing season and produce food in controlled environments using solar heat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Structures used as season extenders to allow for early and late crop production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Structures used to control environment for plant growth, enabling season extension."&lt;SEP&gt;"Structures used to create artificial microclimates for indoor plant farming."</data>
