    <node id="&quot;ORGANIC FARMING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A book written by Nicolas Lampkin detailing rotation designs and organic agricultural practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A certified farming method that avoids synthetic pesticides and additives, typically producing low volumes for premium niche markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of agricultural production focused on ecological sustainability and philosophical roots of sustainable thinking."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of agricultural production that avoids synthetic fertilizers and pesticides, focusing instead on soil health and biodiversity."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of agricultural production that avoids synthetic inputs and emphasizes sustainability and closed-loop systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of agricultural production that avoids synthetic pesticides and additives, often targeting niche markets with premium prices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of agriculture avoiding synthetic pesticides and chemicals, which transitioned from a political critique to a certified commercial product."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of farming based on the use of organic manures and compost rather than inorganic fertilizers to improve soil health and crop yield."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of farming that avoids synthetic fertilizers and pesticides, often contrasted with conventional or biotechnological farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic Farming is a publication written by Nicolas Lampkin that provides guidance on soil fertility, organic matter levels, and nutrient management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is a method of agricultural production that avoids artificial chemicals and emphasizes soil health and humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is a method of agricultural production that avoids synthetic fertilizers and pesticides, focusing on soil health to confer resistance to diseases in plants, animals, and humans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is a method of agricultural production that avoids synthetic inputs and is discussed as a potentially more competitive alternative to conventional farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is a method of agricultural production that avoids the use of synthetic fertilizers and pesticides."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is an agricultural industry and practice that avoids chemical inputs and focuses on soil health and organic matter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is an approach to agriculture that emphasizes the use of organic materials like compost rather than synthetic chemicals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is the agricultural practice focusing on composting and the avoidance of artificial fertilizers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is the agricultural practice of using organic matter and avoiding synthetic chemicals, gaining prominence in Rhodesia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organic farming is the practice of agriculture based on humus and natural soil fertility, advocated as an alternative to artificial manures."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-26c13e874e8e068c20d0f57ebbb98036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282a09c67a0423a68ef7aac02a1b4779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c089588623c308c216371ab7fa2700d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfed52d46f5bf9d5489c4d6b6dddd2cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdc6a311ad979ae94009cd2142c54eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebd7a4883dd14c584a7c1ebf60351fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c3d2efe6371d76745273d9d05718619&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf015c914ceeb12acc1a5f9c6773a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f970a1d154acdb2ae156eac6a317018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b320d4bf5bae3f28f4bca97246cd735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbee5906ccf87e51970dafe6fdbbc7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac72dfa70392b35da5b9538cf9d2202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb807e6a60ab003ee9b4b47c9c83c846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-097e0f884a6200b04603c0d37b1e67fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e54f756180fea1648a4f8a1c56a989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee261677ef65b4f0bf53fae46bfcfb75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9346e9f3a03a86d99c3fadaefd2971e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bc219a87c7ecb22911c9b9083bd392f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b5d1c530308e0e7a1ed5639a5d2b60</data>
