    <node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A farming approach characterized by growing crops or livestock first and then seeking buyers, relying heavily on wholesale prices at elevators and sale barns."&lt;SEP&gt;"A high-volume farming method focused on maximizing yields, often tied to climate and market prices for livestock and crops."&lt;SEP&gt;"Traditional agriculture is described as a business model where producers often buy retail and sell wholesale, facing high freight costs."</data>
