    <node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A branch of farming that focuses on non-traditional crops and methods, often prioritizing niche markets over mass commodity production."&lt;SEP&gt;"A farming approach that identifies market demand first and then grows specific products to meet that demand, often utilizing added value and direct marketing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sector of farming focused on non-traditional methods or ventures, such as aquaculture, to achieve better financial returns."&lt;SEP&gt;"An umbrella term for farming methods that are less tied to traditional industrial practices and may include sustainable or organic approaches."</data>
