    <node id="&quot;WORLD WAR II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A global conflict after which calls to treat agriculture as an industrial sector were repeated."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict after which farm failures were viewed as structural economic problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict after which progressive social reforms were accomplished by liberals."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict after which the Green Revolution began."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict after which the industrial style of farming began to take shape."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict during which 'victory gardens' were a necessity for food security."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict during which sugar was rationed in America, impacting the beekeeping industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict during which sugar was rationed in America, influencing the number of managed bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict that demonstrated the effectiveness of mechanical and chemical technology, contributing to the industrialization of agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict that marks a chronological point after which the food self-sufficiency of the Hopi and Navajo began to decline."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict that serves as a chronological marker for the shift in American agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict that serves as a chronological marker for the shift in American dining habits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict that serves as a chronological marker for the shift toward industrial agricultural models in the US."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict used as a chronological marker for the transition in North American farming practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global conflict used as a temporal marker for the economic status of American and Canadian farmers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The global conflict during which Singer traveled across Asia and collected mushroom specimens."&lt;SEP&gt;"World War II is a global conflict that preceded a shift in mobility between cities and the country due to the increased use of the automobile."&lt;SEP&gt;"World War II is the global conflict during which DDT was widely used as a miracle drug for soldiers."&lt;SEP&gt;"World War II is the historical event after which pesticides first became widely utilized in agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"World War II is used as a chronological marker for the beginning of the industrialization of American agriculture."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f41a230435631a03248889184c93b965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9189adec7b34964ca2342aea2d2b666e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d5818cdf2378e6f878f29ebbca00962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f712d3550c8612228f9fb4dc999ba9b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75d231af67d93bdb8bdb190752047b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa91d64a86fa58173080c8817943c1c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e09b1967f42adef7d483602f8085943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b332155c310163f415407daadd055a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1932cb031e5713bde84668b6254f5c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9373ee84b3a77eb37578d5b0a36a9135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f1a55e5dae098bc247517e22a19be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a371db96fe54cad23b00f1b8eac0eefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a496eb9c6c8d4c66c22b3ac65fe5b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c58f4785be38b80316bcdb547edbe48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bc219a87c7ecb22911c9b9083bd392f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bab4a72f46eead5c78b6d5b292d2ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28d8a78f075f0eccbcec19198a69d0c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28ab0744bd2c8644bdc99e6c30ae80a</data>
