    <node id="&quot;MICHAEL POLLAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A food guru and author of 'The Omnivore's Dilemma' who advocates for eating foods available before 1900."&lt;SEP&gt;"A member of the advisory board associated with the University of California at Berkeley."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and influencer whose work motivates people toward an agrarian mentality and changes in food relationships."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and journalist focusing on food and agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and presenter known for his work on food systems, author of 'The Omnivore's Dilemma', and a speaker at the Bioneers conference."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and speaker who highlights the reliance of the modern industrial-food system on fossil fuels."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and thinker who has laid out the connection between federal agricultural incentives and the rise of unhealthy eating habits."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author who wrote the article 'Farmer in Chief' to advocate for local food and better nutrition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Author of the book 'The Omnivore's Dilemma', who writes about food systems and their impacts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is a popular author who argues for recapturing the richness of an agrarian past through mindful food purchase, preparation, and consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author and journalist who visited Polyface Farm and featured Salatin in his book."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author and journalist who wrote 'Farmer in Chief' and 'The Omnivore's Dilemma'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author who examines modern nutrition science in his book 'In Defense of Food'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author who recounts the story of Cathedral Pines in his work 'Second Nature'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author who wrote 'Farmer in Chief' for the New York Times Magazine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is an author who wrote the book 'The Omnivore's Dilemma'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is the author of 'Omnivore's Dilemma' who brought national acclaim to Salatin's farming innovations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Pollan is the author of 'The Omnivore's Dilemma' who discusses the hidden costs and subsidies in US and Canadian animal production."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e066d43dafd3f92b15fb06eb4836e7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-723017836a70e183adb59eaee6f3d8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-208b104530787322008ebc59d4b56498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-727af20c5834776e4c44ee5e64fd02aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7387a4222a4874eee8b02d6dc3da850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd285deff310269197e8718b28f6076b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59a4b4194753d7082d9b1d100574c96f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48779ccefd65e29504648e87fe948afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30b96f19db572c69aecf37c0f0b030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e0df78d09fb33ee041307abbce7d33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bdeb1a250cfa50c7c4dce2c38964661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8d3828434db854107ffe391485c26e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-659bb35c94ac64eb362d6537bc347e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aebdd45e025fa002441ab3f0054b695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d6381862167ee0d108723409eae36d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b5f0f35b6bfccad911410ecdcdb7c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad5716c9ff65294108cb908fec2e2c8</data>
