      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A book published in 2006 that brought food and agriculture into the national consciousness."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book that explores the origins of the food we eat and the industrial food chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book written by Michael Pollan discussing the complexities of the modern food chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book written by Michael Pollan that counters arguments against growing one's own food by examining the industrial food system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Omnivore's Dilemma is a best-selling book that brought attention to the food system and influenced the growth of interest in Polyface Farm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Omnivore's Dilemma is a book that explores the industrial food system and its impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Omnivore's Dilemma is a book written by Michael Pollan discussing food chains and ethics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Omnivore's Dilemma is a book written by Michael Pollan that brought national attention to Polyface Farm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Omnivore's Dilemma is a popular book written by Michael Pollan exploring the industrial food chain."</data>
