    </node>
    <node id="&quot;URBAN FARMING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A subset of agriculture focusing on food production within city limits, using abandoned lots and suburban yards."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice of cultivating, processing, and distributing food in or around a village, town, or city."&lt;SEP&gt;"The practice of cultivating, processing, and distributing food in or around urban areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Urban farming is the industry of cultivating, processing, and distributing food in or around urban areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Urban farming is the industry of growing food within city environments, characterized by a new breed of farmers who are entrepreneurial and do not own traditional farmland."</data>
