    <node id="&quot;COLONY COLLAPSE DISORDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A phenomenon characterized by a dramatic reduction in hive population, leaving few or no adult worker bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phenomenon characterized by the mass disappearance of worker bees from a colony, impacting global bee populations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phenomenon where bee populations decline rapidly, characterized by a failure of the bees' immune systems and a variety of infections."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phenomenon where honey bee colonies experience sudden population loss, often linked to viruses, pathogens, and environmental stressors."&lt;SEP&gt;"A widespread phenomenon affecting honey bee colonies that impacted the release and relevance of 'Natural Beekeeping'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also known as CCD, this is a phenomenon characterized by the rapid collapse of managed bee colonies where the majority of adult bees disappear, leaving behind the queen and a few young bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also known as CCD, this is a phenomenon where honeybee hives lose most of their adult bees, threatening the beekeeping industry and food supply."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also known as CCD, this is the renamed malady characterized by the mass disappearance of adult bee populations from hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also referred to as CCD, it is the phenomenon of honey bee populations disappearing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder (CCD) is a phenomenon where honeybee colonies collapse, causing significant losses for commercial beekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder (CCD) is a phenomenon where honeybee colonies disappear, causing significant concern for the agricultural industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony Collapse Disorder (CCD) is a phenomenon where the majority of worker bees in a colony disappear, leading to colony failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colony collapse disorder is a phenomenon involving the mass disappearance of worker bees, affecting the bee supply and beekeeping industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ea68cfbbe3fc012d7e18af95936eb15e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b98e2001c5ae7faad90b16ac45f0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0965a7f888753898bdb3624830c9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5780ec82bf5f9eace3f594f7e7368b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b2fa060b49dfcd9523440966c974ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caa3c81818171fc49da384672e628346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c4227735c6f952b192f6d769deb712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27bb80a716045bb643a01fd3aae1d84b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d6c70f937f454a48f71a2feae98bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dac5e0fc4b3efb7d62d286bfe82fe84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4642364014d20a8527d9fb4ec06bdb04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6696f8ef99d58e5e15f540cf5edf86a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8963d676e732e93476c10c3570430d80</data>
