    <node id="&quot;JANUS YOUTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An organization that emphasizes a collaborative approach and partnerships with local governments, universities, and other community groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is a large service agency for runaway homeless youth and teen parents in the Northwest, operating programs in Oregon and Washington, including shelters, alternative schools, and community gardens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an innovative organization that utilizes community gardens as a tool for helping at-risk youth and diverse low-income communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization based in Portland, Oregon, that provides programs for runaway and homeless youths and has implemented garden programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization that creates community gardens and programs, including the development of a community-managed corner store."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization that runs the Village Gardens program and employs a strength-based approach to community empowerment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization that runs the Village Gardens program and operates a community store to sell garden produce and provide local jobs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization that supports community-led change, facilitating programs like community gardening to empower youth and residents in poorer communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Janus Youth is an organization that works with at-risk youth, immigrants, and homeless individuals, implementing community gardens to foster safety and ownership."</data>
