      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"St. Johns Woods is a community garden site in North Portland that served as a model for other gardens."&lt;SEP&gt;"St. Johns Woods is a community in Portland that experienced a high dropout rate and high police call rates before the implementation of a community garden."&lt;SEP&gt;"St. Johns Woods is a community location where Janus Youth implemented a garden project."&lt;SEP&gt;"St. Johns Woods is a community that hosted an initial garden and whose experienced gardeners mentored the New Columbia project."&lt;SEP&gt;"St. Johns Woods is a public housing community in North Portland characterized by diversity and previously struggling with crime and hunger."&lt;SEP&gt;"St. Johns Woods is a public housing community in Portland that became the site of a community garden project."</data>
