    <node id="&quot;RUDOLF STEINER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An individual (1861–1925) widely regarded as the father of biodynamic agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rudolf Steiner is a thinker whose teachings influenced the founders of Indian Line Farm to produce locally what is consumed locally."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rudolf Steiner was a famous German teacher and philosopher who lectured on the relationship between beekeeping techniques and the evolutionary process of bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rudolf Steiner was an Austrian philosopher and esotericist who developed a unique approach to agriculture emphasizing intuition, imagination, and cosmic forces."</data>
