    <node id="&quot;GREENSGROW FARM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A farm in Philadelphia that transitioned its greenhouses into a nursery to attract horticulture clubs and offers various plants and a CSA."&lt;SEP&gt;"A profitable urban food farm in Philadelphia that operates a CSA, farmers' market, and nursery on a rehabilitated contaminated site."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organic farm located in Philadelphia associated with Mary Seton Corboy."&lt;SEP&gt;"An urban farm founded by Mary Seton Corboy that operates on a remediated brownfield Superfund site."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greensgrow Farm is a farm located in Philadelphia that operates a CSA and utilizes hydroponic operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greensgrow Farm is an urban farm located in Philadelphia that focuses on sustainability, flexibility, and avoiding overcapitalization."</data>
