      <data key="d1">"A founder and leader of Greensgrow who manages the urban farm and develops sustainable financial models."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corboy is a leader at Greensgrow who manages the biodiesel operation, the farm's educational programs, and beehives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corboy is the founder and operator of Greensgrow, a former chef who manages the farm's CSA, business strategy, and community outreach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corboy, also referred to as Mary Seton Corboy, is a keeper of beehives at Greensgrow and an advocate for food access and urban agriculture education."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mary Seton Corboy, the founder of Greensgrow Farm and a leader in the local food movement who envisions a future where healthy food is a universal right."</data>
