    <node id="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A European country with well-established truffle orchards and a significant truffle market."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country in Europe where several mentioned farms and the Ministry of Agriculture are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country noted for vine growing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where mycorrhizal associations have been observed on potatoes in hilly regions near the Spanish border."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where the 'dry meadow grass' system is practiced in its central regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where the first attempts at growing mushrooms indoors in caves occurred in the late eighteenth century."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where trials of rationed grazing were observed, specifically in the mid-East area."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is a country in Europe where certain regions utilize the 'dry meadow grass' system for hay making."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is an international destination for Heitkam's queen bee shipments."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is mentioned as a location where vines are treated with copper compounds to combat mildew."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is mentioned as a place where descriptions of pasture rotation were supplied in the eighteenth century."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where Le Foll is a minister and where Brandt was invited to address a meeting."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the Warré hive was developed."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the author encountered typical cases of rationed grazing applying Staehler's principle and toured the North-East region."&lt;SEP&gt;"France is the country where the meadows of La Crau are located and where racing stables consume its hay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where André Voisin conducted his work with cattle on green pastures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where Jefferson served as ambassador prior to the Reign of Terror."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where an international conference took place leading to the Talloires Declaration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where the author studied vine cultivation and noted the imbalance between livestock and crops."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where the study by Anselmi and Deandrea on mushroom inoculation was conducted."</data>
