    <node id="&quot;POLYFACE FARM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A farm characterized by an open-door policy and pastured poultry production, which is the subject of a visitor's critique."&lt;SEP&gt;"A farm in Virginia run by the Salatin family that manages significant public interest through specific operational guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"A successful farm based in Virginia that operates a Buying Club to deliver products to local communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a family-owned, pasture-based, beyond organic farm in Virginia's Shenandoah Valley focused on healing the land, food, economy, and culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a farming operation mentioned as the subject of a visitor's critique regarding animal freedom and compassion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a farming operation run by Joel Salatin that serves as a model for profitable, alternative farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a farming operation run by the Salatin family that emphasizes transparency and community interaction through specific visitor guidelines and tours."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a farming operation that implements biological soil fertility and appropriate technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a high-value, direct-marketed farm operated by Joel Salatin and his family, focusing on nature-mimicking production methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a sustainable farm in Virginia that operates a successful Buying Club for its products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a sustainable farming operation run by Joel Salatin that focuses on food integrity and core values of healing land, economy, and culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is a values-driven agricultural business that focuses on sustainable practices, ecological carrying capacity, and a commitment to quality over growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is an agricultural entity associated with Joel Salatin, known for specific grazing and farming techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is the author's farm which practices pastured farming and avoids vaccinations, medications, and irradiations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyface Farm is the narrator's farm business that sells chickens and has evolved its packaging methods over thirty years."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8da1b16361a783bc112824aaa6fa12fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d53cc613c52fd5080e556f9abb248a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ecda741e6aebaebfb4bbcd928bb80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e930a3eb466e9bb1dfa38b0df50bfd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-208b104530787322008ebc59d4b56498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9970f491e374fd37ac081ba7e9f57b3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd285deff310269197e8718b28f6076b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8cf7a7ce24ea8608d39a989016a49ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8f3e81fd6708a9852f46f0d4ac0a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9172daf9801bd62c5822cc8c36ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2be07f4211935bcb0dfc455ed713f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d31a2f89a77b64e0ae04120df1fdb3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b16258e5de8192443e482a18e2beeb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b5f0f35b6bfccad911410ecdcdb7c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1c7e1b601a6b8a0deb46da88c1a33b6</data>
