      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sociology is the academic study of social behavior and society, mentioned here in the context of a colleague's perspective on sustainability science."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sociology is the academic study of social behavior and society, which provides perspectives on sustainability science and social movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The study of social life, social change, and the social causes and consequences of human behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"The study of the development, structure, and functioning of human society."</data>
