      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Also referred to as Joel Salatin, he is the owner of Polyface and a proponent of land healing through synergistic farming and the development of new farmers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salatin is a farmer associated with Polyface who collaborated with Chipotle to provide high-quality pork."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salatin is a livestock producer and operator of Polyface Farm who emphasizes working with biological timelines and symbiotic patron chains."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salatin is the leader of Polyface Farm who develops and advocates for the farm's guiding principles, emphasizing stewardship, transparency, and autonomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salatin, also referred to as Joel Salatin, is a farmer and entrepreneur who developed the Polyface model and seeks to help other new farmers become sustainable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salatin, also referred to as Joel Salatin, is the owner of Polyface Farm who advocates for sustainable farming, the human touch in business, and the importance of seasonal rhythms over industrial scaling."</data>
