      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A reference to the financial center of New York, symbolizing short-term financial objectives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference to the financial district of New York City, used here as a metaphor for high-risk financial speculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial center of the United States, representing economic value over environmental or social value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wall Street represents the financial center and the growth-oriented mentality of the industrial economic system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wall Street represents the traditional, profit-driven corporate business model that Polyface Farm seeks to avoid."</data>
