    <node id="&quot;COUNTRY NATURAL BEEF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A cooperative consisting of nearly a hundred ranches across the West, focused on producing naturally raised, humanely treated cattle and providing a business model for small-scale family ranches."&lt;SEP&gt;"A cooperative where small-scale farmers pool their products to access larger markets under a single brand name."&lt;SEP&gt;"A for-profit cooperative with a social conscience mentioned as an alternative model for distribution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Country Natural Beef is a co-op that aggregates products from small-scale suppliers to provide volume and brand recognition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Country Natural Beef is a co-operative mentioned as using a branding strategy similar to ASAP's to build recognition and trust."</data>
