    <node id="&quot;WENDELL BERRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A contemporary advocate of the Great Agrarian Goal (GAG)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A member of the Advisory Board located in Port Royal, Kentucky."&lt;SEP&gt;"A poet, novelist, and essayist who is a leading advocate of agrarian philosophy, emphasizing the connection between people, place, and nature."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and farmer whose writings emphasize the moral and social connections to the land and critique the impact of industrial technology on farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and member of the advisory board who wrote the new introduction to the book."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is a contemporary poet and essayist who articulates the moral value of agriculture, emphasizing the connection between farming, nature, and human fulfillment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is a writer and activist associated with agrarian ideals and sustainable living."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is a writer and thinker who updated the GAG philosophy in the 1970s and 80s as a critique of industrial agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is an author and interpreter of Jefferson's views, who argues that farming is essential for the cultivation of moral character and democratic liberty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is an author or thinker who emphasizes the importance of diverse skills and critiques the specialization of modern agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is an author whose work, specifically 'The Unsettling of America', informs discussions on the body, the earth, and agrarian ideals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is an idealist and author associated with self-reliance, stewardship, and the ideal of the agrarian lifestyle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is described as a master of deictic discourse, specifically regarding the practice of farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry is the author of the introduction and the person reflecting on Sir Albert Howard's principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wendell Berry provided the introduction for 'Tree Crops'."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e4e99eda5a55a138ef0183fda88c31a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-723017836a70e183adb59eaee6f3d8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e5357712f2cf6ba2c4ccbed3a53a0be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6cef65b73cbf090d0f46d890908a11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75d231af67d93bdb8bdb190752047b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2658166fe89ce4edb6d09b3e73ec9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b561afe8a3fd467795e6d58a0118448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1c1d4f15102d0ce3bf4f9a157c71f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28ab0744bd2c8644bdc99e6c30ae80a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc543c8a30e99c725b127846caddef9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b8e1c006d239029795854fde00ebba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3330698527e14dc575dc6a2e0e2a7c9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81158f16b3cf87e12a53465738040b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b869f980d6664b6e8d9930d9e12a16</data>
