    <node id="&quot;ANDRÉ VOISIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A biochemist and farmer from Normandy, France, who authored 'Grass Productivity' and developed theories on rational grazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A prolific author and researcher focused on rational grazing, rotational grazing, and agricultural productivity, contributing numerous papers to agricultural journals and conferences."&lt;SEP&gt;"André Voisin is an author and farmer who developed a system of rational grazing to maximize grassland productivity by integrating plant and animal physiology."&lt;SEP&gt;"André Voisin is the author of 'Grass Productivity', an expert in pasture management who achieved significant results through his methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"André Voisin was a farmer and scientist who developed the concept of 'rational grazing' and wrote 'Grass Productivity'."</data>
