      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Allan Savory is a wildlife biologist and alternative-grazing expert who developed the concepts of holistic management based on observations in Africa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allan Savory is an individual mentioned in the context of cattle grazing and soil management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allan Savory provided the introduction for 'Grass Productivity'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Founder of Holistic Management International and an ecologist who identified differences between temperate and brittle environments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Executive Director of the Center for Holistic Resource Management and a biologist focused on wildlife conservation and grassland health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The founder of Holistic Management International who highlighted the essential role of herbivores in grassland health."</data>
