    <node id="&quot;WES JACKSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A member of the Advisory Board associated with the Land Institute in Kansas."&lt;SEP&gt;"A member of the advisory board associated with the Land Institute."&lt;SEP&gt;"A researcher dedicated to selecting perennials that can compete with annual grains."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wes Jackson is a charismatic septuagenarian mentioned in the context of a conference."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wes Jackson is a visionary agriculturalist and founder of the Land Institute who focuses on breeding perennial crops to prevent soil erosion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wes Jackson is an individual thanked by the author for providing patience, hospitality, and knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wes Jackson is an outsider and promoter of alternative or sustainable agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wes Jackson provided the introduction for 'From the Land'."</data>
