      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A group of intellectuals who sought to document all human knowledge, including agricultural practices like rational grazing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Intellectuals from the Enlightenment era who recommended the use of crop and pasture rotation."</data>
