      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Veterinary Inspector of the Belgian Ministry of Agriculture who explained the cause of grass tetany based on rumen contents and ammonia."&lt;SEP&gt;"M. Latteur is a Veterinary Inspector for the Belgian Ministry of Agriculture who developed a satisfactory explanation for the cause of grass tetany, focusing on the role of excess ammonia in the rumen."</data>
