    <node id="&quot;THE FIRST UNIVERSAL LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fundamental rule concerning grass requirements that, when obeyed, can significantly increase grass yield and allow for the use of high rates of nitrogenous fertilizers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a574c5769e1eacad6df009d4dcc7dfc2</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1889}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE SECOND LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A law that derives from the First Universal Law regarding the requirements of grass."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a574c5769e1eacad6df009d4dcc7dfc2</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1889}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE THIRD LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A law stating that animals with the greatest nutritional requirements should be helped to harvest the highest quantity and quality of grass."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a574c5769e1eacad6df009d4dcc7dfc2</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1890}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE FOURTH LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A law specifying that to maintain regular milk yields, a cow should not stay on the same paddock for more than three days, with maximum yields achieved after one day."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a574c5769e1eacad6df009d4dcc7dfc2</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 950}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1890}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FIRST LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The First Law is one of the four Universal Laws governing rational grazing, aimed at maximizing yields of grazing without endangering grass or animals."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27f7fce25d74a4f961f260af1c936fff</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 955}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSAL LAWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A set of four laws, two for grass and two for cows, that derive from one great principle to direct rational grazing."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-27f7fce25d74a4f961f260af1c936fff</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 955}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WARMBOLD SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A specific method or system of intensive grazing."</data>
