    <node id="&quot;ELECTRIC FENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Devices used to contain livestock, mentioned as a modern advancement over manual labor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Electric fences are used as a security measure to discourage bears from investigating bee yards by delivering an electric shock."&lt;SEP&gt;"Electric fences, including movable 'grazing' and 'rest' wires as well as semi-permanent fences, are used to divide paddocks and manage animal grazing areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Movable fences used to control the daily allocation of grazing areas for the cows."</data>
