    <node id="&quot;STRIP GRAZING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A grazing method described by Holmes, which he previously referred to as close folding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A livestock management system designed to imitate tethering by using electric fences to shift the grazing area several times a day to control the intake of grass."&lt;SEP&gt;"A system of rationed grazing where the herd is moved to a fresh area of grass with a wire in front and behind, preventing access to previously grazed areas."</data>
