    <node id="&quot;BRUNDTLAND REPORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 1987 report that significantly shaped the global understanding and definition of sustainable development."&lt;SEP&gt;"A landmark document that defined sustainable development and influenced global technical approaches to sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A landmark report by the World Commission on Environment and Development that defined sustainable development."&lt;SEP&gt;"A landmark report that defined sustainable development and highlighted the link between environment and poverty."&lt;SEP&gt;"A report that defines sustainability in normative terms, focusing on how states should configure international relations with environmental issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"A seminal report that influenced the diversity of approaches to sustainable development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Also known as 'Our Common Future', a report shifting the focus from rights/responsibilities to mutual interest and sustainable development."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1987 Brundtland Report is a significant document that called for 'sustainable development'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Brundtland Report is a landmark document that defined sustainability in terms of meeting the needs of the present without compromising the ability of future generations to meet their own needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Brundtland Report is a landmark document that helped popularize the concept of sustainability globally."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Brundtland Report is a significant 1987 document that contributed to the proliferation and application of the concept of sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5c4efd6d2d98d5f75bdad4ee153609d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98ffdda5b456b304e6585d043b124d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f913efe81de038c2225b4b43be0051b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a94704d54ddaa6d4993efe825f7a171a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b6ff8589dcaca5214d3db25104a4fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5add464238772f14d15e0e73bc4ad2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec46d177c6336f2fe727e22398abaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2e7bd65679a478d0454882e6ccaa48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7489ce827a75940def6586d64969d594&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2ee6e34caebeb195612046b45062fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aebdd45e025fa002441ab3f0054b695</data>
