      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A social movement and philosophy concerned with protecting the natural environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"A social movement that emerged in the late nineteenth century focused on the formation of national parks and wildlife preserves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmentalism is a social and philosophical movement focused on the protection and preservation of the natural environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmentalism is the movement or practice concerned with the protection and remediation of the environment, underpinned by environmental philosophy."</data>
