    <node id="&quot;ECOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ecology is mentioned as a field of study or practice involving preparation for tough times, reflecting the patterns of nature like plants and animals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecology is the scientific study of the relationships between living organisms and their physical environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecology is the study of organisms and their relationships to one another and their physical surroundings, mentioned as a manifestation of cultural value systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"The scientific study of the relationships between living organisms and their environment, used here to inform the understanding of sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The scientific study of the relationships between living organisms and their natural environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The scientific study of the relationships between living organisms, including humans, and their physical environment."</data>
