    <node id="&quot;JOHN STEINBECK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An author who anticipated the device paradigm, noting how tractors prevent drivers from seeing the land as it is."&lt;SEP&gt;"Author of the classic Dust Bowl novel 'The Grapes of Wrath', used by the author to illustrate political philosophies."&lt;SEP&gt;"John Steinbeck is the author of 'The Grapes of Wrath', a work that signaled global fears of starvation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The author of The Grapes of Wrath, known for his character studies and portrayal of the rural working class."</data>
