    <node id="&quot;LIBERTARIANISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A philosophy centered on the principle of liberty and noninterference, opposing government intervention in the socioeconomic consequences of individual choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A political philosophy mentioned as converging around an industrial mentality in the context of agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Libertarianism is a contemporary political movement emphasizing freedom in the form of noninterference, particularly regarding property rights and taxation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Libertarianism is a philosophical orientation emphasizing individual property rights and minimal state intervention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Libertarianism is a political philosophy advocating for minimal state intervention and maximum individual liberty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Libertarianism is a social and ethical philosophy emphasizing personal liberty, property rights, and the principle of noninterference."&lt;SEP&gt;"The libertarian notion of noninterference is a philosophical perspective used to argue for political reforms regarding externalities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5c4efd6d2d98d5f75bdad4ee153609d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aefcb893844980b6670c3646efbfb38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c613cbad49e71f1cd416e26e34150f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98e88e7751e5f203238d792144d7be41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15cd11d4bfedd81ebb62a5bb18b7913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98c0d05f4a0ed6c440d52fd2f060cf55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60de548c5d17e319c0408ab9593e07c1</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 76}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 614}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UTILITARIANISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A moral philosophy and approach that emphasizes the greatest benefit for the population as a whole, focusing on costs and benefits to determine the morality of actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A philosophical paradigm focusing on the greatest good for the greatest number, used to justify or reform industrial agricultural practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A philosophical theory and ethical framework focused on the maximization of well-being and utility."&lt;SEP&gt;"A political philosophy focused on the greatest good for the greatest number, associated here with an industrial mentality."&lt;SEP&gt;"The utilitarian conception of social efficiency is a philosophical framework used to support the internalization of social costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Utilitarianism is a philosophical framework associated with Jeremy Bentham that focuses on maximizing total utility or well-being."&lt;SEP&gt;"Utilitarianism is a philosophical theory that advocates for actions that maximize overall utility or happiness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Utilitarianism is a philosophical view that the well-being of individuals is ethically important, discussed here in relation to welfarism and rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Utilitarianism is an ethical framework mentioned as the ground for arguing that selling goods for less is good because it maximizes personal well-being."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5c4efd6d2d98d5f75bdad4ee153609d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e3da01f719a88fbedfd67f21916a1c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70b90cdc95e55e4bab77a6fde3ec1343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4b745ec575466c823b11b87211e1e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a181b66a2ed76028fc6b6e62f32f23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5004d71f44c231b6939419f18c324a3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15cd11d4bfedd81ebb62a5bb18b7913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a35b2a215a1a617e29c8a09335fbef4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98c0d05f4a0ed6c440d52fd2f060cf55</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 76}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 613}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EGALITARIANISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A philosophy that advocates for equality and the guarantee of opportunity as well as liberty within the basic structure of society."&lt;SEP&gt;"A political philosophy emphasizing equality, mentioned in the context of convergence with an industrial mentality."&lt;SEP&gt;"An ethical philosophy emphasizing fairness, justice, and the ensuring of basic needs and opportunities for all."&lt;SEP&gt;"Egalitarianism is a philosophy that advocates for the guarantee of key opportunities and the equalization of life chances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Egalitarianism is a political and social philosophy centered on the principle of equality."</data>
