    <node id="&quot;MARK SAGOFF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A philosopher whose Kantian environmental philosophy is the subject of a written work."&lt;SEP&gt;"A scholar whose work on price, principle, and the environment is commented upon by Norton."&lt;SEP&gt;"A widely read environmental philosopher who incorporates the concept of community into his Kantian approach to environmental issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"A writer whose work is used to illustrate how agrarian ideals counter contemporary environmental thinking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mark Sagoff is a philosopher who argues that symbolic values are essential for binding people into a political community and critiquess economic rationales for nature preservation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mark Sagoff is an environmental philosopher who applies Kantian philosophical doctrines to environmental ethics and the concept of community."</data>
