      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An author or scholar whose summary of agrarian tenets provides a program for philosophical renovation and reform."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual whose 'tenets' (politics and society) are being analyzed and reformed in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual whose agrarian typology and schema are used to conceptualize a sustainable future."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual whose statements on moral ontology tenets contrast the harmony of farming with the alienation of modern society."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inge is a theorist who emphasizes rural autochthony in their approach to politics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inge is an individual whose tenets on religion and romance are analyzed and critiqued in the text."</data>
