    <node id="&quot;RACHEL CARSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An author and environmentalist whose book 'Silent Spring' exposed the dangers of pesticides and launched the environmental movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and scientist whose book 'Silent Spring' highlighted the dangers of pesticides and sparked the environmental movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Author of 'Silent Spring' and an advocate for environmental awareness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rachel Carson was a biologist and author whose work, specifically 'Silent Spring', sparked the environmental movement by highlighting the impacts of pesticides."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rachel Carson was an influential biologist and author who sparked the environmental movement."</data>
