    <node id="&quot;SILENT SPRING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'Silent Spring' is a book written by Rachel Carson that uses environmental science to influence human action and establish a model for environmental ethics."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book by Rachel Carson detailing the bioaccumulation of agricultural pesticides."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book that stimulated a broad reconsideration of industrial farming methods on environmental grounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"A landmark book written by Rachel Carson that detailed the adverse effects of pesticides on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"A seminal book by Rachel Carson highlighting the dangers of chemical-based agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A seminal book written by Rachel Carson that highlighted the dangers of pesticides."&lt;SEP&gt;"An influential book that helped spark the environmental movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Silent Spring is a seminal book by Rachel Carson that highlighted the environmental impact of pesticides."</data>
