    <node id="&quot;CONSEQUENTIALISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Consequentialism is an ethical theory that understands ethics as being engaged in comparing the expected consequences of alternative courses of action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consequentialism is an ethical view that the acceptability of an action is determined by its outcomes or consequences."</data>
