    <node id="&quot;INDUSTRIALIZED AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A system of farming characterized by intensive practices, potentially involving genetically engineered microorganisms to produce biomass and food."&lt;SEP&gt;"Industrialized agriculture is a high-input, intensive method of farming that the text suggests is a logical conclusion of minimizing land use via the dogma of environmental impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Industrialized agriculture is a large-scale farming system in the United States characterized by efficient production and responsiveness to consumer demand."</data>
