      <data key="d1">"A thinker associated with transcendentalism whose views on the transcendental align with robust idealism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Henry David Thoreau, a thinker associated with the philosophical roots of agrarianism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thoreau is a transcendentalist philosopher committed to interpreting spirituality and society in naturalistic terms, author of Walden, and advocate of wild farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thoreau is a writer referenced regarding the concept of being attuned to the expectations of the land."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thoreau is an author and thinker whose work 'Walden Pond' contributed to the awareness of ecology."</data>
