      <data key="d1">"Former US President quoted regarding the critical importance of soil preservation for a nation's survival."&lt;SEP&gt;"Franklin D. Roosevelt was a US President who promulgated the idea of four basic freedoms, including 'freedom from want'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Franklin D. Roosevelt was the U.S. President associated with responses to the Dust Bowl and soil conservation."</data>
