    <node id="&quot;BORGMANN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A philosopher known for his work on focal practice and the 'culture of the table'."&lt;SEP&gt;"A theorist who developed an account of commodification and discusses the 'culture of the table' and the 'device paradigm'."&lt;SEP&gt;"A theorist whose work on focal practices and the 'device paradigm' is discussed, specifically regarding the separation of sustenance from the land."&lt;SEP&gt;"A thinker who developed the 'device paradigm' to explain how technology separates persons from tasks and the land."&lt;SEP&gt;"A thinker whose ideas on how technical devices corrupt life and the concept of 'focal practice' and 'the culture of the table' are cited by Davison."&lt;SEP&gt;"An author and thinker whose work on focal practice, food culture, and the philosophy of technology is being analyzed."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual associated with the concept of the 'culture of the table'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann is a philosopher and author who developed the concepts of focal things, focal practices, and the device paradigm to analyze the impact of technology on human life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann is a philosopher who developed the theory of commodification and the device paradigm, arguing that technology can empty life of meaning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann is a thinker associated with the concept of the 'culture of the table' regarding food practices and community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann is a thinker who discusses modern life, spiritual alienation, and proposes "the culture of the table" as a means of reform and positive action."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2e87a49973e6281da17305baa1ac5691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75d231af67d93bdb8bdb190752047b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05a27b0a2c8f9742e7ba9f368d106d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10cc72332e9d3a585995c00ff0c00c57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871f5c71b4e227c8d003d7cf1cbe8caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88e0f5242d77b26edc104b13880a55e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d9e4e70cd1b0b4c7667f5453f8cc07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947a257970445f551cab2afa22b20c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e4cd339e78d8d40470267d6f2774f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81158f16b3cf87e12a53465738040b4b</data>
