      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A written work intended for suburban readers, discussing ethics and likely referencing the themes of the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real American Ethics is a book written by Borgmann that introduces the 'culture of the table'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real American Ethics is a written work by Borgmann that develops the theory of commodification and explores the decline of meaning and quality of life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real American Ethics is a written work by Borgmann that discusses the "culture of the table" and other activities to combat spiritual alienation."</data>
