      <data key="d1">"A philosopher who introduced the three-dimensional system of algebraic axes and is associated with Cartesian dualism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Descartes is referenced for his theory of dualism, which, when combined with the notion of self-interest, shapes the understanding of subjectivity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Descartes was a mathematician and philosopher who invented a dualistic theory of reality and the Cartesian coordinate system, enabling the development of modern science."</data>
