    <node id="&quot;CHEMISTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chemistry is a branch of science mentioned as a fundamental discipline alongside physics and microbiology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemistry is mentioned as a modern scientific account that translates the magical modes of contagion and metonymy into a scientific understanding of eating."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemistry is mentioned as a predictable science compared to the variability of biology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemistry is mentioned as a scientific field that is poles apart from the organic nature of biology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemistry is the scientific study of the structure of substances and reactions, used in modern beekeeping."</data>
