      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A U.S. President who emphasized that a nation's success depends heavily on the character of its rural population."&lt;SEP&gt;"Teddy Roosevelt was the President of the United States who intervened in the food industry crisis and established federal government inspection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Teddy Roosevelt was the U.S. President who established the Food Safety and Inspection Service in response to food industrialization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The former US President cited as a representative of a particular vision of rural America."</data>
