    <node id="&quot;RODALE INSTITUTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 333-acre farm and research center near Kutztown, Pennsylvania, focusing on organic and no-till farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"A private-sector model for demonstration farms and agricultural research."&lt;SEP&gt;"A research organization that provides estimates on carbon sequestration potential in soils and promotes regenerative organic agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization focused on organic agriculture and soil health research."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization focused on organic farming, soil health, and sustainable agricultural research."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rodale Institute is an organization dedicated to being a catalyst for change in agriculture, promoting organic farming and soil health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rodale Institute is an organization dedicated to identifying problems, promoting education, and finding solutions for organic farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rodale Institute is an organization focused on organic agriculture and soil health research."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rodale Institute is an organization located in Emmaus, Pennsylvania, based on the work of J. I. Rodale."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rodale Institute is an organization that provides estimates on the carbon sequestration potential of regenerative organic agriculture."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dd2cc9c4737f35caf645ca0995fc6bc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c4b89fc508843db93c9d0cde5f230d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c831bab98bbdfad723b02fe3873b0080&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a052fbc2d60ddc1ffd04862131ebb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11905a2957c65e69706bb6f3ff65226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46ddfffa0309c4f9eea8332588a12855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c85d29b7ea5f401d310b53fcf8e8292&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-760ee66daea81221ff77e23a75a9dedd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00ca524316427ad52b01cb6871e49060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21be92c21b7215c9e86b338cd15d5f1f</data>
