    <node id="&quot;PETROLEUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A finite nonrenewable resource used as a primary example for calculating resource sufficiency and sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A fuel source that shifted the historical energy path and enabled the expansion of industry and suburban living."&lt;SEP&gt;"A naturally occurring liquid oil used as a raw material for chemicals and fuel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petroleum is a fuel source that replaced the historical necessity of gathering firewood for heat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petroleum is the energy source and raw material that the author argues sustains the current grain-fed beef and dairy factory system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petroleum is the source of cheap energy that powers equipment and enables the production of chemical fertilizers, fundamentally changing agricultural paradigms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The oil-based energy industry described as a 'blip' or anomaly in the long history of human energy use."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f7cdcda2273c4d3e807e607b85d38791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2ed8a27091d9b374270e513324aa63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc84578a2a9965cca7bdee803ba8f735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c852a940991461ca29b76becfe24a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3fdd7b941341283d68dce92a52c682d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba112c4310be31fc99e92db5c7bc7f59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5725b5cf994f00b7667ce2db39717e7f</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 157}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 825}]</data>
    </node>
