      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fossil fuel used as a modern utility for heating homes, contrasting with the traditional use of wood."&lt;SEP&gt;"An energy resource considered as part of the total global energy supply."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c852a940991461ca29b76becfe24a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e284959bc106cad9570b943c5c94ff</data>
