    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEAK SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A perspective on sustainability asserting that human well-being must not decline, allowing for the substitution of natural capital with human-made capital."&lt;SEP&gt;"An environmental philosophy where environmental values are grounded in human attitudes and uses, often equated with resource sufficiency."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5004d71f44c231b6939419f18c324a3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddd79b341dfcb637bbc86f0265484513</data>
