    <node id="&quot;STRONG SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A perspective on sustainability asserting that natural capital must not decline over time and should be preserved for future generations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An environmental philosophy asserting that nature has intrinsic value and should be preserved regardless of human utility, often equated with functional integrity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5004d71f44c231b6939419f18c324a3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddd79b341dfcb637bbc86f0265484513</data>
