    <node id="&quot;BEEKEEPING INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The beekeeping industry involves commercial bee outfits and hobbyists, currently facing challenges like colony collapse disorder and varroa mites."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry involves the agricultural endeavor of keeping honey bees for pollination and honey production, currently struggling with mite infestations and chemical costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry involves the commercial raising of bees for honey production and crop pollination services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry involves the commercial raising of honey bees and the production of honey and pollination services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry involves the commercial rearing of bees for honey production and pollination services for agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry refers to the commercial and professional practice of managing honey bee colonies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry refers to the commercial sector involved in the harvesting, processing, and selling of honey and bee-related products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The beekeeping industry refers to the professional practice of managing bees, which Steiner predicted would face difficult times."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial and hobbyist sector focused on the raising and management of bees, encompassing various operational scales from backyard to commercial."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial and professional sector dedicated to the raising and management of bees for honey and pollination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial and professional sector dedicated to the rearing of honey bees for honey and other products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial and professional sector focused on honey bee management and the production of hive products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial sector involved in raising bees, which suffered significant losses due to mite infestations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commercial sector involved in the production and sale of honey and the management of bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional and commercial sector dedicated to the management and harvesting of honey bees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional and craft-based sector dedicated to managing honey bee colonies for pollination and product harvesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional sector dedicated to the management of bee colonies for honey production and pollination services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional sector dedicated to the raising of honey bees and the production of honey and other bee-related products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional sector involved in the rearing of bees and the production of honey and beeswax."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professional sector involving the rearing of bees for honey production and crop pollination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sector involved in the rearing of bees and the production of honey and other hive products."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3ab2196ed3cfc357ea2968eacf70e5cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68758adec1ce1aa5af3106fe56e7d365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fda7a4926edf81f63ac6018a79d56da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0965a7f888753898bdb3624830c9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c53fadbf74ed2ba310e067e40c2b8ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d24243f158f01183a67e8cbfb4f883b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb8a6921fbda7ded5cb998b73b807b12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f7e3ba7786fba28e5d662f74af986c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e09b1967f42adef7d483602f8085943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba112c4310be31fc99e92db5c7bc7f59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f592015c17fe4fa51a988e96c438765&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2691225b766f240d4e630fa426b6e435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d196d4416fd2851aefb4923ab8ddf3d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa20c48947aea0538518c8462c9c2696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d6c70f937f454a48f71a2feae98bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfec606648bbeb5ca28bfc5c7e8323a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c586403b9fbc7d85f3084e5a000eb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a3d7885d5c7d0196e5f8b1d626686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbe3628e117427ed1c35a791b026e9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4675cad2098c6c5be67a3bdcf6e32e53</data>
