      <data key="d1">"A city in California featuring a gritty main agricultural strip known as Crows Landing Road."&lt;SEP&gt;"A city in California marking the southern range of Miller's almond orchard colony placement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A city in California's Central Valley used as a base for visiting almond orchards."&lt;SEP&gt;"A city in the Central Valley to which bee hives are transported."&lt;SEP&gt;"A city where Miller uses a gym."&lt;SEP&gt;"Modesto is the city where fire chief Gary Thompson is located."</data>
