    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AFRICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A country facing phosphate deficiencies and implementing an urban compost campaign to support agriculture during wartime."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country in Southern Africa."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country that has a nation-wide organization for converting town and city wastes into compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where Viscount Bledisloe worked to make the region 'compost-minded'."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where municipal composting is successfully in operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A country where organic farming practices, such as composting and humus restoration, are being widely adopted."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location where Western settlers established extensive farming practices on virgin soil."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pastoral country where over-stocking and incorrect veldt management led to the creation of semi-deserts and gullies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A region where a ten-year conflict between chemical farming and humus-based organic farming took place, resulting in a victory for humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"A region where settlers trekked northwards from the coast to exploit natural resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is Wessel's hometown and the location where the fall of apartheid led to the renaming of streets."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is a country from which farmers came to visit Brown's farm."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is a country where the battle between artificial fertilizers and humus was fought and where soil fertility was a major concern."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is a location where pioneers of organic farming have been waiting for a trial against users of artificials."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is the country where the urban composting process is being adopted across various provinces."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is the country where the utilization of municipal wastes is being studied and implemented."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is the geographic location where Cape bees are found."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is the home country of a farmer who questioned Brown about organic food prices and global hunger."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Africa is the home country of the farmer who questions Brown about organic food prices and global hunger."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country where urban compost production is being implemented to solve refuse disposal and fertilizer shortage problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"The home country of the temporary visa workers employed by beekeeping outfits in the northern plains."&lt;SEP&gt;"The location of Howard Buffett's farm used for producing cover-crop seeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The native origin of red fire ants and small hive beetles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The origin country of several characters, including Jaco, Barry, and Wessel."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f4f83b407929c9c73f6150edfd6dc214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff08f7dd7004bc2552c2a3d5b2401a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26c90f74f233ea23d233d1c4023e91f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-428e9d4590233f76ed9b454b23423b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da0d4465cef76e19b327a5ee61850fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de45d40ec65e6186764314ff7c6c5c95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-875244dbf5b92a0cbabb5deff3c5629e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebd7a4883dd14c584a7c1ebf60351fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9e3bb2a40d743661733d6555e921ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6308a55dba63b8652c56c1424f2ab3b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec66802bc43867cee6b1280e5876d8d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29383e9e22d8107e16031bc3bcb5739d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e31ea2adf95c6c787a2e0a6348bae1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f685240aeecfc4a0556f03c0af930046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf21622f766ab205d57f7915f9105bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1609048eb7cbdd2e53212288aa2d0e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c624dd8b186ae512a6523bc877d431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87fba51a43132c1fcb0a51e42da41fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d8286e6a8f25ded00034a7a287f09cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79a1a0cb0810e8c4db52132d6d4c6596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e075666adecb76602095c816ea6583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2c449f01571421e5d465367c2416a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7e8b4bde4465470684d8ec0af5b158a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b499dcfe1898219f12671e71bc768e6</data>
