    <node id="&quot;MONSANTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A biotechnology corporation mentioned in the context of scientific debates and transgenic manipulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A global leader in transgenic modification and seed production that patents new life forms and has been involved in legal battles over seed contamination."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large agricultural corporation associated with transgenic modification."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large agricultural corporation mentioned as being threatened by a shift toward 'real food' and criticized for its role in transgenic modification."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large agricultural corporation often questioned by consumers regarding the use of genetically modified organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large agricultural corporation representing the industrial food system."&lt;SEP&gt;"A major biotechnology company known for holding intellectual property rights for genetically modified materials and controlling independent research access."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agrochemical giant that advertises soil health as central to the future of agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a biotechnology company known for producing transgenic seeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a company mentioned for its development of Roundup and genetically modified glyphosate-tolerant crops."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a company that produced glyphosate (Roundup) and initially dismissed concerns regarding weed resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a corporate entity mentioned in the context of nutritional standards and corporate value statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a corporation involved in the creation of transgenic life forms and the enforcement of royalty fees for its genetically modified seeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a corporation known for introducing recombinant bovine growth hormone (rBGH)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a large agricultural corporation associated with the production of soy and industrial farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monsanto is a large corporation involved in food and seed production, characterized by the author as a dubious entity to trust for sustenance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The manufacturer of glyphosate and patented seeds for glyphosate-resistant crops."</data>
