      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A prominent agricultural research institution of which the Woburn Experiment Station is a branch."&lt;SEP&gt;"A renowned agricultural research station whose findings are used to support the policies of the Ministry of Agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agricultural research institution associated with the Broadbalk plots and the publication of annual reports on crop experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agricultural research institution whose soundness is questioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agricultural research institution with a branch at Woburn."&lt;SEP&gt;"An institution whose disciples include the Ministry of Agriculture and agricultural colleges, associated with the promotion of chemical fertilizers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rothamsted is an agricultural research institution whose staff and Director were unable to identify the cause of the soil trouble."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rothamsted is mentioned as a location of preliminary training, likely referring to the Rothamsted Research institute."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rothamsted is the site of the celebrated Broad-balk wheat trials and is referred to as the Mecca of the orthodox in agricultural research."</data>
