    <node id="&quot;AN AGRICULTURAL TESTAMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A book or document containing guidelines on the method of charging compost pits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1940 by Sir Albert Howard addressing general readers and scientists regarding agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1940 that summarizes the author's life work on the connection between soil fertility and the health of plants, animals, and humans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book written by Sir Albert Howard detailing his agricultural findings and inquiries."&lt;SEP&gt;"A influential book on agricultural practices and soil health written by Sir Albert Howard."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication containing ideas and information regarding composting and agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication describing methods used in aerating large compost heaps since the Indore experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication or document containing notes and records on agricultural practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A written work by the author, containing summaries of ten years of research on fruit trees."&lt;SEP&gt;"A written work containing descriptions of how green-fly attacks on peach and almond trees were induced or checked."&lt;SEP&gt;"A written work containing detailed descriptions of agricultural methods, specifically those used at the Shahjahanpur Experiment Station."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agricultural Testament is a book that describes experiments in aerating large heaps and the progress of the Indore Process."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agricultural Testament is a book written by the author in 1939 discussing the link between soil fertility and public health."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agricultural Testament is a foundational book written by Sir Albert Howard regarding artificial nutrition and manures."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agricultural Testament is a published work by the author containing results on compost and rice."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agricultural Testament is a written work containing detailed investigations on crops like the guava."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c77007ae0e7683a83dbebd6436fa3c92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9679e4b4c295f8198842b6678d29d7bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1fbfc96142fb2e1554de743e1067f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc30b96f19db572c69aecf37c0f0b030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1932cb031e5713bde84668b6254f5c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5332439349dbc980b17ca1f0c9044b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fd8b3490e045fee1663a444486deee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282a09c67a0423a68ef7aac02a1b4779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0745126232bd711152a0184bdc10060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5181a113eeffb24e1b85b75fd426e595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c29c0579cd80e1a7dbd0b335ca85272&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be6b9145cdce9275f8166f477a4339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6930a29b100d665f24c78c209eccf850&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9591c5b4bbe7f3fce9fbed5a80fcb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3a2894d687bee611b8e8f3c8f48f03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1e151c82b3fc06c79b833667c8828b</data>
