    <node id="&quot;INDUSTRIAL ECONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An economic system that treats agriculture and humans as analogues of industrial systems, focusing on specialization and chemical/mechanical technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"The industrial economy is described as a system that views creatures and agriculture as analogues of industrial machines, based on a materialistic premise."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-59f100ffb03d2213b475479279d60e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1932cb031e5713bde84668b6254f5c5d</data>
