    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAW OF RETURN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fundamental principle of nature's farming regarding the return of organic matter to the soil to maintain fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"A principle formulated by Sir Albert Howard emphasizing the need to return organic matter to the soil."&lt;SEP&gt;"A principle or law related to the return of nutrients to the soil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law of Return is a principle proposed by Sir Albert Howard emphasizing the biological basis and necessity of returning organic matter to the soil to maintain fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Law of Return is the conceptual principle describing how Nature returns nutrients to the soil through decay and decomposition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The law of return is a principle in sustainable agriculture where what is taken from the soil is returned to it to ensure no waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"The law of return is a principle stating that the agriculturist has a duty to restore to the land what has been taken from it to maintain the soil's capital."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2b6f8bdb7d910bab994c57a8e47dd2c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59f100ffb03d2213b475479279d60e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc063bcbb000e43f7427394a529bddaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550966fca0f2f090187553fe9bc99e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b8ee2e72fa6f47d60cc453b7711fdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85f843ce4c9e414f5a474793768109cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b54f2244b271720007b07b922cce2640</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 159}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 832}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHEEL OF LIFE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A concept from an eastern religion describing the ever-recurring cycle of birth, growth, maturity, death, and decay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Wheel of Life is a concept from an eastern religion describing the cycle of birth, growth, maturity, death, and decay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Wheel of Life is a metaphorical representation of the continuous natural cycle of growth, decay, and renewal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Wheel of Life refers to the balanced cycle where plants use humus at the same rate it is manufactured."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-59f100ffb03d2213b475479279d60e37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff6fbf3f5ff09df476cd44ec19e3d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b6f8bdb7d910bab994c57a8e47dd2c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550966fca0f2f090187553fe9bc99e80</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 159}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 831}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1858}]</data>
    </node>
