    <node id="&quot;INDORE PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A method of composting organic waste to create manure, used to increase crop yield, improve quality, and enhance disease resistance in tea plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of composting that has spread in temperate countries, focusing on the fermentation of organic matter to create soil nutrients."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of converting vegetable and animal residues into humus/compost to improve soil fertility and crop yield."&lt;SEP&gt;"A method of manufacturing humus (composting) used to increase soil fertility and cotton yield."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method of composting developed for agricultural use, initially in India and later considered for Western agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method of composting promoted by Mr. F. C. King."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method of composting that accords with natural law and is successful across various climates and farming types."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method of composting used to convert organic waste into humus for agricultural improvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method of making compost developed and refined in Indore, which improved crop yields and quality across various industries."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific method used to convert various town wastes into humus."&lt;SEP&gt;"A system of composting involving the collection and admixture of vegetable and animal wastes, maintained with specific moisture and aeration to create nutrient-rich compost."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of composting and humus manufacture designed to improve soil fertility and crop yield."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Indore Process is a method of converting animal and vegetable wastes into compost or humus to improve soil fertility."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ef18907b2721a1b6d2d67779b9587976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23fed92ffe59e67730588150c2a1cbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77164fb123ff92d554d3e1bc99f7301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82bc20afcc996297375967f9d759b0ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6308a55dba63b8652c56c1424f2ab3b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b11ced128b01bd1e4592b2aede7c0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd82d44193e10128839b8f9cf5d0309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10c2b55c35f65d6b5ffdc8c603ef37f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2c449f01571421e5d465367c2416a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629af50f18d6312eb4d088cb93078b2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cf4e22031f2bda63a4a6a91f0d2c5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3a2894d687bee611b8e8f3c8f48f03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1e151c82b3fc06c79b833667c8828b</data>
