    <node id="&quot;NEWS-LETTER ON COMPOST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'News-Letter on Compost' is a publication that reports on organic farming and composting practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication containing articles and technical descriptions regarding composting and sewage sludge preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication containing articles such as 'Is Basic Slag Really Necessary?'."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication containing detailed financial and agricultural results of composting cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication decided upon in 1941 to disseminate evidence and promote the use of compost for soil health."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication embodying facts and opinions regarding composting, published three times a year to support the campaign for soil fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication that describes advances in composting technology, specifically the improved muck spreader."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication that detailed Dr. Scharff's composting campaign in Malaya."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication that shares information, supplements, and letters regarding composting and soil fertility."&lt;SEP&gt;"News-Letter on Compost is a publication containing research papers on composting and soil health."&lt;SEP&gt;"News-Letter on Compost is a publication that shared findings on how artificial manures affect the quality and life of wheat straw thatch."&lt;SEP&gt;"The News-Letter on Compost is a publication that reprinted the author's writings and replies in 1944."</data>
