    <node id="&quot;ARTIFICIAL MANURE INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The artificial manure industry consists of companies producing chemical fertilizers that opposed the organic humus movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The artificial manure industry is the sector of agriculture focused on the production and application of chemical fertilizers, largely founded on the results of the Rothamsted trials."&lt;SEP&gt;"The industry focused on the production of chemical fertilizers, which opposed the author's organic farming ideas."</data>
