    <node id="&quot;TBH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TBH, or Top Bar Hive, is a style of beehive characterized by top bars and a lack of standardization in design, requiring different inspection and maintenance techniques compared to Langstroth hives."&lt;SEP&gt;"TBH, or Top Bar Hive, is a type of beehive design where bees build combs naturally from top bars, allowing for easier inspection and manipulation compared to some other designs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Top Bar Hive, an alternative beekeeping design that uses single top bars to allow bees to build comb in a more natural shape."</data>
