    <node id="&quot;AUTOCLAVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A device used for short-cycle sterilization of mushrooms through heat-treatment to prevent insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A machine used for sterilization by utilizing high-pressure steam."&lt;SEP&gt;"A machine used for sterilization of substrates and equipment using high-pressure steam."&lt;SEP&gt;"A machine used for sterilization via high-pressure steam, used by cultivators to treat harvested mushrooms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A machine used to sterilize equipment and media using high-pressure saturated steam."&lt;SEP&gt;"A machine used to sterilize spawn plastic bags containing moistened hardwood sawdust or chips."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pressure vessel used to sterilize sawdust bags at 15 psi for 2 to 3 hours."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pressurized steam sterilization device used to treat substrate bags to prevent contamination and enable mycelial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pressurized vessel used for sterilization of substrates using steam and pressure to eliminate contaminants."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pressurized vessel used for sterilizing bulk substrates, acting as the centerpiece of the production process in mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pressurized vessel used to sterilize equipment and substrates by using high-pressure steam to kill microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An autoclave is a piece of equipment used for sterilization, specifically mentioned here for checking seals and drains to prevent contamination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equipment used for high-pressure steam sterilization of substrates to eliminate contaminants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equipment used in the clean room of a mushroom spawn laboratory to sterilize substrate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2b55e55c8fb7ad2fc82b21eddc75408b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5222544fbac611153c3910b7a49b1632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea472dfebfe03f6968437bd2ffedd3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7c54ea888763f1d03f685097757427&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1ef2ff91f86f93c8d85ce6a2b3161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91456f98a926e6abc80385dc245cc777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a03386c8fdad1c49ade13815bc6b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d4b92006db2e1bfffb89c800fc0a3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c412d7b08105fd05e24e46b46f204fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a3fb337bf89926a26a3b13ae25b3cc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99b3c5799adf4153f31a635e31e46c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e08f9019a6721b44f903e073f95b43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7465ed3b02e2efa8c7b1c2c113bd9f9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0844446be98c91a11acfc07bb4139aa8</data>
