    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAWDUST SPAWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A cultivation medium where fungi are grown on sawdust, used as an inoculum for substrates, though often resulting in lower yields than grain spawn for certain species."&lt;SEP&gt;"A medium used for inoculating mushrooms, ready for use within 2 weeks and used for selling, inoculating beds, or creating plug spawn."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mushroom inoculum created using sawdust as the base medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"A stage of mycelial expansion created from grain spawn, positioned downstream from the cultures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bags of sawdust generated from G3 jars, used for further expansion into fruiting blocks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mycelium grown on sawdust, used to inoculate fruiting substrates such as logs or supplemented sawdust formulas."</data>
