    <node id="&quot;THE MUSHROOM CULTIVATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A book authored by Stamets and Chilton (1983) providing technical details on grain moisture and kernel sizes for mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book authored by Stamets and Chilton discussing mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book authored by Stamets and Chilton in 1983 detailing mushroom cultivation techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book coauthored by the author and Jeff Chilton in 1983, providing extensive information on the identity of molds, bacteria, and insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book coauthored by the narrator and Jeff Chilton in 1983, providing extensive information on the identity of molds, bacteria, and insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book or publication used as a substrate for Reishi mushrooms to fruit from."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book providing technical guidance and information on the cultivation of mushrooms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1983 by Stamets and Chilton providing descriptions of flies and their life cycles in mushroom culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1983 by Stamets and Chilton providing information on mushroom cultivation and competing molds."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1983 that contributed to the decentralization of the mushroom industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book published in 1983 that describes liquid fermentation and injection techniques for mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book written by Stamets and Chilton in 1983 that provided simple techniques for making sterile culture practical for mushroom cultivators."&lt;SEP&gt;"A book written by the author providing guidance on mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication from 1983 providing detailed technical guidance on the cultivation of mushrooms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication from 1983 that marked the beginning of the decentralization of the mushroom industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication used as a medium for the fruiting of P. ostreatus."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mushroom Cultivator is a book published in 1983 that provides instructions on tissue culture and spawn generation for cultivators."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mushroom Cultivator is a book written by Stamets and Chilton in 1983 detailing cultivation techniques for Agaricus bitorquis."</data>
