    <node id="&quot;HEPA FILTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"High-Efficiency Particulate Air filters used to prevent airborne contamination in mushroom cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-Efficiency Particulate Air filters used to remove contaminants from the air to maintain a sterile environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters that eliminate contaminants down to 0.3 microns with 99.99% efficiency, making sterile tissue culture practicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters that make sterile tissue culture practicable by removing contaminants from the air."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters used for positive pressurization in laboratory environments to maintain sterility."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters used for positive pressurization to maintain air purity."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters used to clean and refilter air in laboratories to minimize the need for toxic disinfectants and eliminate airborne contamination."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters used to maintain positive pressurization and air purity in the spawning room and pasteurization chamber."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-efficiency particulate air filters used to remove contaminants from the air to maintain a sterile laboratory environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2b55e55c8fb7ad2fc82b21eddc75408b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a51001a824f450f3fd025943f870fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea472dfebfe03f6968437bd2ffedd3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65267590bffb12f3cd0f8ce0a5d22bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32de504d30a1122aa14d9280ed6f3736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712d329f1d17d42190f6d0a2c21d7b42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99b3c5799adf4153f31a635e31e46c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e12830990f7ea8d716253d971a2d83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4cc27ce4680927f691a69bcfefb4b8</data>
