    <node id="&quot;ANNE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anne is a companion of the author who traveled to England to study farming programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is a companion or partner of the narrator who was involved in the process of restoring life to their soil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is a person mentioned by the narrator as someone who uses mulch in their garden."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is mentioned as the person who used kitchen-fed worm compost and biochar in the veggie beds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is the author's wife and a gardener who converted a barren yard into a garden using organic matter and conservation agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is the narrator's wife who initiated the creation of a garden, leading to the discovery of soil restoration through organic matter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is the wife of David R. Montgomery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anne is the wife of the author who accompanied him to the Eden Project."</data>
