      <data key="d1">"Ohio State University is an academic institution where soil scientist Rattan Lal is based."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ohio State University is the academic institution where Lal took a position after his work in Africa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ohio State University is the location where Le Foll and Brandt had lunch with other farmers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The academic institution where Rattan Lal maintains his office and conducts long-term soil experiments."</data>
