      <data key="d1">"A farming management concept based on observing, measuring, and responding to inter and intra-field variability in crops."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agricultural management strategy that uses high-tech and low-tech tools to optimize crop yields and resource use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Precision Agriculture is a high-tech farming management system used to track rotations and yields and customize fertilizer application rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Precision agriculture is a farming management concept; in this context, it is described in its low-tech, low-capital form."&lt;SEP&gt;"Precision agriculture is a modern farming approach utilizing various technological tools to optimize crop yields and resource efficiency."</data>
