      <data key="d1">"A center in Amanchia where people from across Africa come to learn about conservation agriculture and no-till farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"A gathering point or organizational entity associated with farmers practicing no-till agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"The No-Till Farmers House is a residential compound in Amanchia used for training visiting farmers."</data>
