    <node id="&quot;GABE BROWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A farmer in North Dakota practicing no-till and cover cropping who outproduces neighbors by defying conventional wisdom."&lt;SEP&gt;"A farmer or expert who recommends the author visit David Brandt's farm."&lt;SEP&gt;"A farmer or scientist who provided support and experience for the author's research."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual quoted regarding the paradox of herbicide efficacy and the persistence of weeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual who discusses faith and regenerative agriculture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gabe Brown is a farmer and advocate for sustainable agriculture who uses intensive grazing, no-till practices, and cover crops to rebuild soil health on his ranch in North Dakota."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gabe Brown is a farmer mentioned as sharing Brandt's vision that smaller, more profitable farms are a solution to modern agricultural problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gabe Brown is a farmer who adopted new soil health practices and collaborated with Fuhrer and a team of experts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gabe Brown is an individual who noted that large-scale meat processors are more prone to salmonella outbreaks due to operational challenges."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1ffffbaa4bb43bbfd0d35d31576ac37d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2986d7fbca317b773ba0556aa0e4ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46ddfffa0309c4f9eea8332588a12855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bfda3cdec46f8ab5a386ecf15ae6edb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30aca7d7248a398bf698c2f58e21181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00ca524316427ad52b01cb6871e49060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ebf23631547617747b7c2b24e2249cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c624dd8b186ae512a6523bc877d431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faafe8310294120e238fe933148dfbad</data>
