    <node id="&quot;MOYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Moyer (Jeff Moyer) is a persistent researcher and expert in organic farming at the Rodale Institute, specializing in no-till organic methods and soil biology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moyer is a researcher or expert in organic farming who emphasizes the adaptation of practices to specific farm conditions and guides visitors through demonstration plots."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moyer is an expert in organic farming at the Rodale Institute who developed a roller-crimper for weed management and practices rotational tillage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moyer is an individual involved in the field trials and who guides the narrator through the plots."&lt;SEP&gt;"Moyer, also referred to as Jeff, is an expert associated with the Rodale Farming Systems Trial who advocates for organic and regenerative agricultural practices."</data>
