    <node id="&quot;BRANDT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Brandt is a farmer and expert in soil health and cover crops who practices no-till farming and herbicide-free agriculture, often traveling as a speaker to share his methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brandt is a farmer who implements conservation agriculture, focusing on no-till methods and diverse cover-cropping to improve soil health and reduce chemical inputs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brandt is a farmer who implements soil-building practices, such as no-till farming and cover cropping, and conducts personal experiments to compare organic and GM corn yields."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brandt is a sustainable farmer and former Marine Corps sergeant who specializes in no-till farming and the use of cover crops to improve soil health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brandt is an experienced farmer who utilizes cover-crop mixes to increase soil carbon and advocates against the necessity of crop insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brandt is an unconventional corn and soy producer and a leader in the cover-crop revolution who utilizes no-till farming and diverse cover-crop rotations to improve soil health."</data>
