      <data key="d1">"CAFOs, or Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations, are industrial-scale livestock production facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations (CAFOs) are industrial-scale livestock production systems that rely heavily on pharmaceuticals and sophisticated infrastructure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations (CAFOs) are modern industrial agriculture systems that confine large numbers of animals in a single location for efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations, a specific type of industrial livestock production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations; an industrial farming system that separates animals, plants, and manure, often resulting in ecological damage and hazardous waste."</data>
