    <node id="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Beekeeping, also known as apiculture, is an ancient craft, science, and professional industry centered on the management and maintenance of honey bee colonies, typically within man-made hives. This dynamic endeavor has evolved through several historical eras, transitioning from primitive honey collection and a cottage industry into a modern commercial business and professional service.

The practice involves a wide range of technical methodologies and specialized equipment—such as bee brushes and escapes—and requires a significant commitment to continuous learning and regular maintenance. Key operational activities include hive inspection, swarm control, insulation, monitoring colony health, managing brood-rearing cycles, splitting hives, and the creation of nucleus colonies.

The primary objectives of beekeeping are the production and harvesting of honey and beeswax, as well as the provision of essential pollination services for crops, which sometimes involves "traveling beekeeping" where colonies are transported to specific agricultural sites. Additionally, the industry encompasses the sale of bees and the genetic preservation of colonies.

Beyond its economic and industrial functions, beekeeping is described as a passionate hobby and a gateway for humans to reconnect with the natural world, fostering mindfulness regarding insects and plants. By focusing on conservation and the survival of hives, practitioners view beekeeping as a way to improve the environment and give back to the world. Despite its benefits, the profession currently faces modern challenges related to disease and shifting demographics.</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a07d3f020711352b6c4bb16ca80f182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5bf9269446157b7f585b574d80342a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f928b6b6595520556e61b690ad234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651bdc43ce4f434b1e5c689b3528db55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98c7cc01c4ab993650d10adde34992fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b2fa060b49dfcd9523440966c974ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b96aee8fce1383e3a88948dc5d0aad4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe964bb050fa238a66a95e9fc7e0164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2561d50e9ed17231e465cfacf7c96345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59256e1e091228ca7c65d0b5d8fb2348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9de2778ec077dc2aae514901168a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e4ee41b73c052db0b90b67ae962bc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da9216023ced68a9aa545d43ca1d419f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a230cf3f43e673f8797237bc5d97548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7838234dc3bb876ced6fabea41222695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b6278bcba2e2dfe6f1202b147f87019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92090c6a7f40e420c9b8e4d961a9a21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35f6eef0d2ff08b3a3b7b2c2e942edde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150b6a45026cb8f7ac1617459ec54b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5886c64a8eabfd9136afefc941f06b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d84e8388b1b3835cf15d2729a7bded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6099b8ab1322280eb9653d60e287b9d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb74059818291619d1eccac02bb8df4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6246333458a48f952d940bddf47976a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b5f53667458d570c2b31bf11f9a153b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60575ab4028f754c314fcbcee392db85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59970fe46f1c3b11508247730ae6145d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1205bbac28347dacca693957c5262ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693ffb57dfcac7260fd0345d7e791e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b652e467f32b1db6fbb1cf5b9315586e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e823f4271cc674d258a850b82bd8b70b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64bd868f29e83effc96703b72e21cc18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc4c6eeeb090dac26dee2e9e9154d95f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99f3cfb348742cf36dd48849fb6973f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086256446757da0fffa536b4247d998d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27f6271ed08f494278ee4aa9601556c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a7084302d57591ff02e89969b4c3abd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caeb5d2bd49a72e7116025708c05e9f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7bad5a771d728b5a074404c1820fac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f78f364d74eca8b91a5a10f5f9de4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464158e8ae6f11d3eade0bd5a72fca55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3025455da6b06dabe347fe4878bb963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91fddbed5da654e2156cc50a2222b4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788901d0b4d29c039e6a86eed1ac4b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbcdd66d1199b5aa96f04600977274c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c85b379d83c9f869435c42e6568dee9</data>
