    <node id="&quot;VOISIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">VOISIN is a scientist, author, and researcher renowned for developing the "rational grazing" method, a comprehensive system of livestock management and pasture utilization. His work, which includes the definition of "intensity of grazing" in 1950, focuses on grazing management methods, the design of pasture division, and the strategic placement of watering points. VOISIN is also credited with creating French expressions based on German terms to describe these rational grazing concepts.

As a technical innovator, VOISIN developed specific pasture equipment, including the guillotine gate and the quadripod, and wrote regarding the mechanics of forage trailers. His research spans a wide array of agricultural topics, including the impact of ploughing on soil structure, the growth dynamics and rest periods of grass, and the "hungry years" of pasture growth. Additionally, he provided data on nitrogen estimates for Ladino white clover in North Carolina and demonstrated that plantain is among the richest plants in natural antibiotics. VOISIN also provided authoritative insights into bovine physiology, specifically regarding the limited amount of energy a cow can allot to mastication.

Associated with Regent Farm and the Middleburg Research Station, VOISIN's practical applications are reflected in the "Voisin pastures." Furthermore, he is the photographer credited with the images of grazing livestock, farm landscapes, and the quadripod featured in the text.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d7c5ab489b9afb713e1778a666791d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b4ce0e1733524ee2593f791efd8d97e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c6be08cda7aded7207a29a510cfd328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-247402674d5c963ad9fab940a3f2ef1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09b74f41d21f409ec5a0b3f597231b30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5de83212539cb3933ac7783d0ed745be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7fde71bc9acad15f6ba8d9629c1284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac85679d77a60f266bf38a2e2dc7a33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6a574882030ef63f3252a0c0ac0f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e03533555109549978c4b517473a757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f7ff88609163f475b8f3d69a80bfe2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27f7fce25d74a4f961f260af1c936fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6a3916ac8149a7e7fa1a4d6a8ad322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cf7746378c6e8d2b371fa8b0e35955&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4daabebb5348b51a93adbacf688e892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0169a1c039e632cea63d0b0e23a7089d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be12d9958cb9a319997a5bf0e64b56d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08a903bcc29ba54a545f0fbfc922a7b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-588e8ab2d6f49cb7d1f03d1823e3c363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64483ba12fe1f78e2a2dc57df518f6b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ece25ffa878c37debd5633b99a6ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c11548aaf18b892f15ea3985a824bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa752fa09edea3d82b95c339728d49cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c115f424d1edfe6938bfaa6c7f5270</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 201}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 981}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 1897}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIRGINIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Virginia is a U.S. state located within the Appalachian region, specifically including the Blue Ridge mountains and the Shenandoah Valley. It is the home of the city of Lynchburg, the community of Weyers Cave, and organizations such as Lynchburg Grows—an urban farm and historic greenhouse site—and Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD), which operates within the state's southern Appalachian mountain region. The state is also the location of Polyface Farm and Buffalo Ridge, as well as the Southern Seed Exposure Exchange.

Agriculturally, Virginia is known for its legendary pork, with historical farming practices involving pigs raised on chestnut and acorn crops and a 1700s fall climate ideal for natural curing. The state serves as a source of useful agricultural publications and a location where local farmers provide livestock to distributors and cooperatives; notably, Molovinsky visited various Virginia farms and processing plants to source produce for a cooperative. In this state, long-term studies on biosolids application have shown increases in soil carbon content, and river sand sampling has been conducted for erosion research.

Additionally, Virginia is the location of the author's farm, where they service various restaurants, adjust seasonal production for winter, and were mandated to join a workmen's compensation program. The state has also hosted matchmaking workshops for landowners and farmers and is noted for a narrowly averted law that would have made it illegal to drink milk from one's own cow. Historically, Virginia is also recognized as a province in America that housed one of the nine colleges or universities mentioned by Franklin.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-48fbe13ccbab1daf20dc4c993f911dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3719df28d4b1d531ea7e65f401d9c6a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fa32270872b031b3439ffee7b8e80ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fac6f2d596c9d9fe2bc3b9afda4f10df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679416bb166ca53a86b2b2f4dbcf7deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626a48dbfe67b1f55d1d46c5b8d30097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a455477cb1650ac90158af4dc52a5454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b16258e5de8192443e482a18e2beeb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0707af73cf1b7f988c4cf8ff24fb2972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-912655071bfb31832bd5d960fea37c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef5e8f2029677f15d6ee8815b5828c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa6369dd0584465f07387131c6d28e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e930a3eb466e9bb1dfa38b0df50bfd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b26f04bc8df6a747ead835cc8d210eec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e0df78d09fb33ee041307abbce7d33e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65dc312cbeeaa82060b27a69060e671d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2be07f4211935bcb0dfc455ed713f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c575c019780e689390cd685c690159f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e0be7f0a6204d59bd58a3fab64b0fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0dfef7989eab5ae8b58770f9786cac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d53cc613c52fd5080e556f9abb248a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a1691cbf0dd4f90c53d989cbd7bb332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3fdd7b941341283d68dce92a52c682d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-217f96b464101a2919ccf861b25fe27c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db735f250cad30d060b6ea644151e172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4daf18984831b8673c2be0060612bd34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61443c6300dbc7b6e2bd6de269518650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7342c811b61a9c3bb8956112826bc2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4953d5aa366add6d40468e1643931eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba841e41630d5b5e46b271cb1a11d579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0d4e7d44014acab56e26cbaa12a896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e6b92e2d699a91a2124de7f67662fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2407aee3e13e5b0137dd68e9b8424c99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947ecff2bb83daf7b7263f98f4a72ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-497b3487d00eabefe426a10fa32f8010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f4b1f56482ca88dc86d76611131fea</data>
