    <node id="&quot;RATIONAL GRAZING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Rational Grazing is a comprehensive livestock and pasture management system developed by André Voisin, designed to maximize the productivity and sustainability of grasslands. Based on universal laws of grass growth and the strategic interaction between plants and animals, the system focuses on the optimized movement of livestock through a planned division of pastures into paddocks.

The core of Rational Grazing involves the precise control of the "period of stay" (the duration animals spend in a paddock) and "rest periods" (the time allowed for grass to recover), ensuring that livestock are rotated strategically to optimize grass yield, improve botanical composition, and preserve soil fertility—particularly during dry weather. By utilizing systematic rotation and rationed grazing, the method aims to increase the efficiency of forage use, improve the botanical quality of the flora, and increase stocking rates compared to continuous grazing.

Ultimately, Rational Grazing is designed to enhance the health and performance of livestock—including maximizing milk yield and meeting the specific nutritional needs of various herd groups—while simultaneously regenerating the pasture to achieve maximum profitability and sustainable agricultural productivity.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ebaf316bf066f2c202110b483d92a8dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed80c461fcd7ae24e2d82990c8272a1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6edc542831f1b21640469c548af6b2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5de83212539cb3933ac7783d0ed745be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee44e954d1abb009f061fd993b844c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f09c1defaf6c7013ba4ecd1cac40b5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb662dfdbe902c6b759c1dcd149c71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1deeb7b911291b61d68984f35349109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b968976fa1cf8fa9d4d1d922950ef30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27f7fce25d74a4f961f260af1c936fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c583da6fce90c421f7955d582682c8c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71693cd9138b6f0587b3bd7e7c04e4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418420d01189e0b2be4207485e8eabea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a574c5769e1eacad6df009d4dcc7dfc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99192bcfcb30814c4ed015c9e5b18ba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c665e654c8f8cb10f4fdb30c92234e59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76d65cb7a255c82a11696f947cda5684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cd47d3de7f87ca5f9d415c2e16ce46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b8b8502370c6624f8c498266b33fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ed5666e76c6deff78175910984bd83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8df78d16e962e8d1ecc294f9d88aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bee7d5fac9dd017be636b45597ba373&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64ece25ffa878c37debd5633b99a6ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23e5f99a619696ef6f85cee50cb43c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba12d9ba4613c0906f5bddff73f23dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efe222393fecd71e1d91aa776f41fdc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b7266683ce075bd299f9731e6b76917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c11548aaf18b892f15ea3985a824bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b61ec4c92f8837c4ca00c85162881f8</data>
