    <node id="&quot;NEW YORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">New York is both a U.S. state and a major city located in the mid-Atlantic region of the United States. 

As a state, New York contains the Adirondack Mountains and is the location of Greenwich, Tivoli, and Hearty Roots Farm. The state's upstate region provides apples to New York City schools and is the site where wild Maitake mushrooms were discovered in a colonial graveyard. The state is characterized by specific climate and market conditions that make late-fall raspberries a profitable crop, and it is a region where mushrooms are especially common. Historically, New York is noted as a "province in America" that housed one of the nine colleges or universities mentioned by Franklin. The state has a history of beekeeping challenges, with reported bee losses in 1917 and a 2005 instance where Hackenberg lost 40 percent of his bees in apple orchards. Additionally, the state faces issues with abandoned prime farmland and offers specific state income tax breaks and farmland assessments based on income requirements. The author recently visited the Delaware Highlands within the state.

As a city, New York serves as a massive publication hub and the location for numerous publishing houses, including A. A. Knopf, DK Publishers, Macmillan, Oxford University Press, Cambridge University Press, Free Press, Interscience Publishers, Hafner Press, Marcel Dekker, Inc., Academic Press, Atheneum/Macmillan Publishing Co., E.P. Dutton, Artisan Books, Workman Publishing, and Appleton. It is also the location of The Devin-Adair Company. New York City is a significant market where pink mushrooms are highly valued, and it is a place where specific types of honey are favored by buckwheat honey enthusiasts, as well as by Orthodox Jews and Muslims. The city is cited as a primary example of where implementing urban farming and waste reduction could significantly impact energy and garbage systems.

Further associated with New York are the invention of the Cool Bot and beekeeper Chris Harp.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1c38cc0e564389a3d4ae302974b0b214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7cdcda2273c4d3e807e607b85d38791&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fda7a4926edf81f63ac6018a79d56da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72caeaba0c728846da485a71abaefe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b5c0bc112ae933d4ee86da4c902dbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0707af73cf1b7f988c4cf8ff24fb2972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59256e1e091228ca7c65d0b5d8fb2348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-989f778e9e52a68acf976f5a25635203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e3afeba6371f424fecc018c4eba8fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77998f10068e98f374d36ce3925f2d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1b198fa71b44d8dd33dcfc2eb267be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36d7831b967b917f74ffc6f58aa73452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1aeb9ecf61216ee718f86040aa4be47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6e2616a1e85abbd2d0e461c49fe199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6d051705a68de142e311b176db586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4e81fbbac0112182435a83213e9dfed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04be01c6169d0bdd92b10dca615a3936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea472dfebfe03f6968437bd2ffedd3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cde244979b46e407b0021ca3c1f6a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71948845b1b02b694d90417b30fbfe54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a1691cbf0dd4f90c53d989cbd7bb332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1f94cc5f14959e322093167c5b5ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6795ac13deea0240f9376837154726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ca632d7241d4efd7901ef6c477cffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f903b090101aaac0825a1ba8eadbc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69a6f293580aa424d04ad67558a1427b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92a2d0f16b987692eda5ab803a901a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4d487f6f6a84222a4d78c42b68cbb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f716dbb539b9e685559a05a8f9f5d54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83a76ca1c47f7cacf6e710bdb030db56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ba994699462c439a6f9a2bb0144cfcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed3c8bf1e06fc42b2f0350a73f6a10c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f0647a3635bf95add745e093fdc57c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f025d035915467517ca424f6e1fea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba5b6ce3f655d35674a35ac27097ce0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ce07a51ef582a63eb6d5d10aec550fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68cd627aeee527d8b94e4d0c15a02c11</data>
