    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Agriculture is a fundamental, global industry and the oldest of the great arts, serving as the foundation of settled life and the primary means of human subsistence. It is broadly defined as the science and practice of farming, encompassing the cultivation of soil, the growing of crops, the rearing of livestock, and the management of pastures to provide food, fiber, wool, and other essential products. Beyond simple production, Agriculture is described as a vast biological complex and an ecosocial hybrid system that serves as a keystone for human-environment interactions, shaping and being shaped by the environments humans inhabit.

The industry encompasses a wide spectrum of methodologies, ranging from traditional organic and natural methods to industrial biotechnology and high-input scientific farming. However, this evolution has created significant tension; while some view Agriculture as a bulwark for capitalism and a source of entrepreneurial opportunity and respectability, others criticize the detrimental effects of industrialization. Specific concerns include the loss of unifying power through commodification, the abandonment of mixed husbandry, and the impoverishment of soil caused by industrial systems and the use of artificial manures. Consequently, there is a significant focus on the transition from conventional, yield-based practices toward sustainable, resilient, and soil-building systems that prioritize soil health over mere quantity.

Economically and socially, Agriculture is regarded as the "nurse of industry" and a fundamental sector that should hold a primary position in the economy. It carries immense symbolic value, impacting homeland security, international relations, and public policy. Furthermore, it is viewed as a path to independence and a vehicle for developing sound moral character. Because of its complexity, Agriculture is presented as a subject requiring holistic research rather than fragmented departmentalism, acting as a primary focus for philosophical and moral debates regarding sustainability, human needs, and the obligation to preserve the natural cycles of Nature.</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c4a3f4f76cd87581e1acc8d4a5d71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f80535289583d0b174a792dec934f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb61501e645127f9021b6ed20f37476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf60421969007759eb279ddb028ec67b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d63fd363bb5b8e772c6c0e59279b321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32dccbe80c5a2907ae81c8b0b4b49792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cd2b14e898ba9fd4a8dd4ab14491966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c089588623c308c216371ab7fa2700d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59117004fc63073a0e772f7ea1ce4399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-571b3fa101d4bb8e213e6691eda956ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ba9b55dcb2de76a73fed895734246f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-553c0f788a5df6c23a481c0a3efdaabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd2cc9c4737f35caf645ca0995fc6bc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99a4f6bfcac3f89a5e412fbeeb432e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a35a75b0bc3a557b68f4dc4d5219ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0140bfa459686f6fbd2f146390859bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b994c4aaecb06bda273f0e09161deddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550966fca0f2f090187553fe9bc99e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a7d4e49c6e48a2727071f21a879ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-736ea6711636125c220e214941062b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363259c41f29f455370656b3d04be170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6acd1bd95566acfb8cf6c422a4a4f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b332155c310163f415407daadd055a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf015c914ceeb12acc1a5f9c6773a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c70a5acc631338be6403992b6cfc4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b547b6cef0753ad76c2ec6637caea67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f327dcda762579e3e8ff20376026fc06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70b90cdc95e55e4bab77a6fde3ec1343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43cf98889488511c44c0f261bb2eadce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f10e286b0ce488adcc83133b6ebb3a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef01b6c92c978eb990b4b99dc85a664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e410bfae74fb6896e8e0079e060cf83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1609048eb7cbdd2e53212288aa2d0e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b43d31102c54c8a9ea45b442a0a3169b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca4f0fa36ad8d06c0f3a5233524fac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380a03b915a35f23558c861103a74ff7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbfeb7e87aab57b5e1710b2ca71c0a2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce