    <node id="&quot;POLYFACE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Polyface (also known as Polyface Farm) is a diversified, multispeciated intensive farming operation that serves as an artisanal producer of high-quality, "beyond organic" real food, including grass-fed beef, pastured poultry, and acorn-finished pork and sausage. Operating as a sustainable alternative to industrial farming, Polyface emphasizes community ecology, land healing, and a symbiotic balance between animals and plants. The operation utilizes a portable infrastructure model and grazing management practices—such as moving shelters daily to provide birds with fresh pasture—to ensure natural, forage-based diets and energy efficiency.

Beyond production, Polyface implements a human-centric business model focused on internalizing the true cost of food production to avoid "price charades." The entity utilizes a decentralized production and processing model, which includes leasing land from other owners and relying on external services such as T&amp;E Meats, of which Polyface is the largest customer. 

Polyface is deeply committed to educational and community growth, providing a model for supporting new farmers through internships, apprenticeships, and various leasing and payment arrangements. The farm promotes a relational connection to food by allowing patrons to visit the site, interact directly with producers, and participate in community-based buying clubs. To expand its reach, Polyface seeks to supply its high-quality products to local markets, restaurants, and universities.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-63208f55f5e282db2dc1514f989da622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab7679e841cce082d6f5f864896c9afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b16258e5de8192443e482a18e2beeb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-244b46a035b1d5494275c24656572f4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fe577c30758db251a37049d98b4b6a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf26e9a63fe788b2d8ce72fc174f104&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e60fd4f718c23663990adfcf7d9450a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1120b5aeee44f2d69487e813229514c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41976a69de893e06188aa8717a3c4235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6389477351f5ce08f5964ec7d9d64e85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80e9303eecbce86ea3b4046fab412a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e3d2608ec774e94ae3556c5b7d8cd1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc914258f181b38f4e96df2f72d9edbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13be51c877a39586f32961bf1539ba15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae492e842a1e2f920eff1769b3eb72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22f3967d311f087b86fc91bd0708142c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76dc9223bba683a907708b8d0a81acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a1691cbf0dd4f90c53d989cbd7bb332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4941781303f19e745042aad2237f81ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f116a0e83303d4ebb8971bd977ade7c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2431b3b4552aa63a72178a202c92bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07373ff8a8e2c42149614780aa736a26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b87537885c268eea02e5c3eda3297f5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bece2f190b302e65065ab1536812a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a9921cf42c52cb58653d22cae4ded08</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 141}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 765}]</data>
