    <node id="&quot;CONSERVATION AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">Conservation Agriculture is a comprehensive field of farming research and practice focused on sustainable land management and restorative soil-building. This agronomic system is based on three core principles: minimal soil disturbance (including no-till farming), the maintenance of permanent organic soil cover through the use of cover crops or crop residues, and the implementation of diverse crop rotations.

Associated with figures such as Beck, Boa, and Brown, Conservation Agriculture aims to enhance soil health, boost soil quality, and increase soil organic matter to sequester carbon and restore fertility. By promoting microorganisms and protecting the soil, these practices are designed to reduce soil erosion, increase drought resistance, and decrease the need for chemical inputs. Ultimately, Conservation Agriculture serves as a sustainable approach to increase crop yields and profitability while saving farmers time and money, ensuring the long-term sustainability and effectiveness of land management.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df17faa8ab3183c29a4b66fae2714601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf30061723e36aeb151e27ffee39b145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff08f7dd7004bc2552c2a3d5b2401a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26c13e874e8e068c20d0f57ebbb98036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a052fbc2d60ddc1ffd04862131ebb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0b6fef18a1087bc65e4b1a287287f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1791122186a3d77110cdc1caf21599f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faafe8310294120e238fe933148dfbad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32451426a025c7d576a101e275962be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4e21be11265296d18e2a7632e5e359e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c815d00442f9e3b9ab5e9b4912abcf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84ff78a393ff1a0888c9e615bbd889db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9781b535da0b0987f5145a6a7ffd9b81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d580c7d10d48422c163979c0340d0afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6c7b5a78bab1ad1dda59f93699b5aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cf015c914ceeb12acc1a5f9c6773a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f57077126bc61f1a2588c34ca9614e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ffffbaa4bb43bbfd0d35d31576ac37d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9da95d303f996398774af59a2327d539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54338209a610084057de4fde840e5cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5244a72295d4f84fc85246a4eb4df315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09a6cc9d68abf9affc9cdaea5699d882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b9cd4a1993414b6bec903748a75cd</data>
