    <node id="&quot;NORTH CAROLINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">North Carolina is a U.S. state and a region in the United States that faces soil degradation challenges. It is the location of various cities and landmarks, including Asheville, Durham, Moravian Falls, the Research Triangle, and the Central Carolina Community College. The state is also home to several academic and agricultural institutions, such as Duke University, Warren Wilson College, Morgan Farm, Peregrine Farm, and Hickory Nut Gap Farm.

The state's agricultural landscape is characterized by a diverse range of operations and initiatives. The Appalachian Sustainable Agriculture Project (ASAP)—which focuses its operations in North Carolina and facilitates connections between farms, tourism, and economic development—operates here, along with Growing Minds, SEEDS, Inc., the DIG program, and the Walking Fish CSF. Other local entities include Gladheart Farms, Goat Patrol, and the operations of Sam Dobson. The state is also the birthplace of Charlie Jackson.

North Carolina has been the site of specific agricultural studies and observations, including the estimation of nitrogen contributions from Ladino white clover and a survey of retail and wholesale produce buyers. While the state is noted as a source of useful agricultural publications, it also faces environmental challenges, such as fish kills caused by overflowing manure lagoons from Concentrated Animal Feeding Operations (CAFOs). Additionally, the state is mentioned in reference to an American director and as the location where a woman raises pigs using rotten milk from a yogurt factory.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bbbece9d51f6abc4742c05514bea625e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b4ce0e1733524ee2593f791efd8d97e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3719df28d4b1d531ea7e65f401d9c6a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b664b68583390f1a748abc957021ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5c5221ac2ba78f42a5fab7540274b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d27f0b8018ca6a374ee44c20b082d0b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626a48dbfe67b1f55d1d46c5b8d30097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-553c0f788a5df6c23a481c0a3efdaabb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8965f3e3965322fdf5c53aebddde1e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2658166fe89ce4edb6d09b3e73ec9d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8f3e81fd6708a9852f46f0d4ac0a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6eed415e2d01ca41ab07d4cac89623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4387433fb465c65791d73fe4c7fb964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc2a008e21cba06a8a9ad6e540ff138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d53cc613c52fd5080e556f9abb248a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef2c308d995bae34c938de2dff3f5cf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4daabebb5348b51a93adbacf688e892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6376ac179a2df4bf1471d8fed5f7bc23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-488bc663aa4ded0ca40ac601222c065d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ca632d7241d4efd7901ef6c477cffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87aef9adbbf32f7b8ba9d9db34d927a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4834997360d230865ed92b7133ca993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf82877961e08200011936c26d80e1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbabc72a18ceaedb14452609db7d256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ecda741e6aebaebfb4bbcd928bb80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4daf18984831b8673c2be0060612bd34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5944a88ca415780f3d4838a47d068512&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fee18f76430d121ab613984069f209e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba841e41630d5b5e46b271cb1a11d579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0d4e7d44014acab56e26cbaa12a896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c16ea96bc625614680cc6d8276e6ca</data>
