      <data key="d5">"Both are categorized as protective gear used by beekeepers for safety during hive inspections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are listed as part of the conventional protective clothing worn by beekeepers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are mentioned as components of conventional beekeeping protection worn by beekeepers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7f35b518c8481093038a38bf2b64387d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf15980aea2d79d85e102a8e8c947bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d621a8bb4b7eb07600bbbfbdafcad0b</data>
