      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Romans developed early knowledge of beekeeping, such as feeding bees in times of need."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-96f78f364d74eca8b91a5a10f5f9de4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SKEPS&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Skeps were domed hives made of straw used by advanced societies in the first era of beekeeping and were precursors to modern hives."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-96f78f364d74eca8b91a5a10f5f9de4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
