      <data key="d6">chunk-7197b1327e60ebc0c4ee2f3ed2bd7e13</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ROMANS&quot;" target="&quot;ROME&quot;">
      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Romans established and inhabited Rome, and the city's influence and growth impacted their rural agriculture."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7197b1327e60ebc0c4ee2f3ed2bd7e13</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ROMANS&quot;" target="&quot;LATIFUNDIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Romans developed the latifundium, which were great estates worked by slaves that replaced smallholder farms."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7197b1327e60ebc0c4ee2f3ed2bd7e13</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ROMANS&quot;" target="&quot;ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Romans inhabited Italy and eventually destroyed the food-bearing capacity of the region through poor land management."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7197b1327e60ebc0c4ee2f3ed2bd7e13</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
