      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A queen excluder is a device designed to prevent the queen from moving between different parts of the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"A queen excluder is a tool used to force the queen to stay in the lower part of the hive, though shallow supers can act as a natural excluder."</data>
