    <edge source="&quot;APICULTURE&quot;" target="&quot;APIARY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"An apiary is a location where beehives are kept, which is a central part of apiculture."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2fcbe54cf1d72b0c107b42a5d283af2d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Industrial Revolution hastened and enhanced the evolution of beekeeper classifications and attitudes."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-1b5f53667458d570c2b31bf11f9a153b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text describes the Green Revolution as the 'younger sister' of the Industrial Revolution, both contributing to a food system dependent on nonrenewable energy."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-fac6f2d596c9d9fe2bc3b9afda4f10df</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Industrial Revolution is linked to the transformation and commodification of agriculture and the decline of traditional farming."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Industrial Revolution led to a huge human population and a system where agriculture subsidizes industry by transferring food to manufacturing centres."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a35a75b0bc3a557b68f4dc4d5219ba</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;KARL POLANYI&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Polanyi studied the transformations in work rules and rural practices that paved the way for the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-4be7aab5835b5557dffc1a1c85fd336d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;MIXED HUSBANDRY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The system of mixed husbandry and its principles of soil conservation began to break down seriously with the advent of the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-86a7f4aa7178f919427c0954ff8040e8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ENCLOSURE ACTS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Enclosure Acts led to a new agriculture and the exploitation of resources that is customarily referred to as the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;WATER POWER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Water power was used as one of the first labour-saving devices that set the Industrial Revolution in motion."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;STEAM ENGINE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The steam engine was a key labour-saving device that drove the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;INTERNAL COMBUSTION ENGINE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The internal combustion engine is discussed in the context of the shift away from draft animals and grazing components that dominated prior to the Industrial Revolution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The internal combustion engine was a subsequent labour-saving device contributing to the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b806e4889dafc2c60b53b1b25c1ad3a8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ELECTRICAL ENERGY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Electrical energy was the final agency mentioned that helped set the Industrial Revolution in motion."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;WATER-BORNE SEWAGE SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Industrial Revolution created urban populations whose waste removal needs led to the development of the water-borne sewage system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-591de784bfb5c3376bd8c1f7c511d0e3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author suggests France's wrong turn in vine cultivation was likely driven by wine demand following the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2be6b9145cdce9275f8166f477a4339b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ASIA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">4.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Agricultural practices in Asia (returning manure/night soil) are part of a broader history of soil husbandry; separately, soil husbandry in Europe fueled the labor supply for the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Soil husbandry in Europe pushed peasants into cities, providing the cheap urban labor that fueled the Industrial Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;MESOPOTAMIA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">3.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Mesopotamia is cited as an ancient civilization undone by failing land, contrasting with the industrial/chemical methods of the modern era."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ANCIENT GREECE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">3.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Ancient Greece is cited as a civilization undone by failing land, serving as a warning for modern agricultural practices."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;U.S.&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Plowing on U.S. farms contributed significantly to carbon emissions, with a large portion of carbon added since the Industrial Revolution coming from plowing."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-12a052fbc2d60ddc1ffd04862131ebb9</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;ICE AGE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A climate scientist suggested that the loss of soil organic matter since the Industrial Revolution may have delayed the return of another Ice Age."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-12a052fbc2d60ddc1ffd04862131ebb9</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;COLONIAL AMERICAN&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text contrasts the intrepidity of teenagers in colonial American biographies with the period of the Industrial Revolution, when the term 'teenager' emerged and their societal contributions waned."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-40e284959bc106cad9570b943c5c94ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;PONY EXPRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text discusses the age class of teenagers and young adults in the context of the Industrial Revolution and mentions that many Pony Express riders were teens."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-40e284959bc106cad9570b943c5c94ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;PEAK OIL&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Martin Payne characterizes Peak Oil as an 'Industrial Revolution-sized' disruption."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-32ea25deaf7ccaf87a5c9a61060e9100</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
