      <data key="d6">chunk-3ad59b3ec786d96ceb0cf84e4d5b8446</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROPANE TORCH&quot;" target="&quot;EUROPEAN FOULBROOD&quot;">
      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A propane torch is used to sterilize hive parts to prevent or treat the spread of diseases like European Foulbrood (as implied by the sterilization section preceding the EFB section)."</data>
