      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A radiation chamber is mentioned as an alternative method for sterilizing equipment to manage diseases such as European Foulbrood."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ad055bc816d7df3212732523b38332d8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EUROPEAN FOULBROOD&quot;" target="&quot;SACBROOD&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Colonies with heavy sacbrood infections can be treated using the same methods as European Foulbrood, such as requeening or adding capped brood."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ad055bc816d7df3212732523b38332d8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
