    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;NORTH AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Miller describes the varroa mite as 'swaggering like a colossus across beekeeping in North America,' indicating its widespread impact on the continent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Varroa mites entered North America during the 1980s."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c2ef2a61b557f4940ffb63973d9ebeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e6144bc70a4f4cbdf43cfe854a269e</data>
