    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Varroa mite arrived in and spread throughout the United States, likely via illegal queen bee imports."&lt;SEP&gt;"Varroa mites have caused the loss of thousands of colonies in the United States."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c2ef2a61b557f4940ffb63973d9ebeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c20cb47e818c53af03d9f00b71d1b9f</data>
