      <data key="d4">13.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Both are mentioned as causes of havoc and loss within the beekeeping industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parasitic varroa mite is suggested as one of the numerous contributors to the cause of Colony Collapse Disorder."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-caa3c81818171fc49da384672e628346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27bb80a716045bb643a01fd3aae1d84b</data>
