    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;JOHN MILLER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"John Miller discovered varroa mites in his hives in the early 1990s, which became a significant pest in his career."&lt;SEP&gt;"John Miller learned a difficult lesson regarding the treatment and resistance of varroa mites in his hives."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0984220078ce71973ba3b0fa10b37a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001b3ca70f42e9cc2ce8671a72009988</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;NORTH DAKOTA DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The department's inspector identified the presence of the varroa mite in Miller's bee yard."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e8e6144bc70a4f4cbdf43cfe854a269e</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;MILLER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Miller battles varroa mites in his hives and spends his time researching ways to kill them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Miller contrasts the manageable nature of previous bee diseases with the catastrophic impact of the varroa mite."&lt;SEP&gt;"Miller's bee hives were infested by varroa mites, which challenged his pride and perception of his beekeeping skills."&lt;SEP&gt;"The varroa mite has negatively impacted Miller's honey production per hive."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e8e6144bc70a4f4cbdf43cfe854a269e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d75b31628c95bce2d1de33c7d05683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbcdd66d1199b5aa96f04600977274c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9eafb5519ae847ebc95f1b6bd7a3901</data>
