      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Gary Oreskovic was the apiarist who first spotted the varroa mite on his bees in September 1987."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;DAVID MIKSA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Miksa helped identify the varroa mite based on his previous experience seeing them in Europe."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-dff8f6d16d91f6c080ca2e3b7cb50555</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARROA MITE&quot;" target="&quot;ANDERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Anderson possesses knowledge of varroa mite genetics and warns about their inevitable arrival in Australia."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-001b3ca70f42e9cc2ce8671a72009988</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
