      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"John traveled to Mexico, where his adventures piqued the author's interest in mushrooms."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6f665f8b0722afc51f2876a389252d66</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MEXICO&quot;" target="&quot;EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Wild picked mushrooms from Mexico are imported to Europe due to decreased local availability."</data>
