      <data key="d5">"The electric fence was specifically used on the farm visited in the North-East of France to manage the herd."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-527055291c96f565ab1e262a61faefd9</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ELECTRIC FENCE&quot;" target="&quot;THE FARMER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The farmer uses and moves the electric fence to manage rationed grazing for his livestock."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7ac85679d77a60f266bf38a2e2dc7a33</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ELECTRIC FENCE&quot;" target="&quot;FIXED FENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Electric fences are often used as provisional measures before graziers install permanent fixed fences based on experience."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6f09c1defaf6c7013ba4ecd1cac40b5a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
