      <data key="d6">chunk-6f09c1defaf6c7013ba4ecd1cac40b5a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ELECTRIC FENCE&quot;" target="&quot;UNTOWARD ACCELERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The use of electric fences can lead to untoward acceleration, which can be mitigated by using marking pegs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6cd47d3de7f87ca5f9d415c2e16ce46f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ELECTRIC FENCE&quot;" target="&quot;VOISIN&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Voisin is cited in the context of pasture management and the dangers of relying solely on tools like the electric fence without understanding rational grazing."</data>
