      <data key="d4">13.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Agripreneurship is the business application of agriculture, while sustainable agriculture provides the whole-farm approach to achieve these profitable and sustainable goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both are listed as principles and concepts within the index of the agricultural guide, with sustainability linked to the goals of agripreneurship."</data>
