    <edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL AGRICULTURE&quot;" target="&quot;BROWN&quot;">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Brown criticizes conventional agriculture, noting that its reliance on tillage and nitrogen kills beneficial soil biology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brown provides an insightful and concise indictment of conventional agriculture."</data>
