    <edge source="&quot;CONVENTIONAL AGRICULTURE&quot;" target="&quot;CONSERVATION AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Brown contrasts the results of the full conservation agriculture system against conventional agriculture results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conservation agriculture is presented as a lower-input alternative to conventional agriculture, often yielding similar or better results while reducing pollution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-54338209a610084057de4fde840e5cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1791122186a3d77110cdc1caf21599f0</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
