      <data key="d6">chunk-326af0d2f4f5cb2e60b5f3dc889133d2</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;VIRGINIA ATTORNEY GENERAL&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Virginia Attorney General is a representative/official of the government who provides legal opinions on the validity of waivers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9d628ebc9fbc7db25894f19c606113e6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SANTA CLAUS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">3.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Santa Claus is mentioned hypothetically in a waiver intended to absolve liability, which the government (via the attorney general) deems worthless."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9d628ebc9fbc7db25894f19c606113e6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;KING GEORGE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author compares the current government's perceived tyranny and control over food choices to the tyranny of King George."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9d628ebc9fbc7db25894f19c606113e6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FOOD POLICE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The 'food police' are described as the agents or officials of the government who enforce sanctioned food standards and restrict food freedom."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9d628ebc9fbc7db25894f19c606113e6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
