      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Philosophy is used to clarify disputes and provide tools to understand the contested ideals and definitions of sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Philosophy is used to scrutinize the concepts and value judgments that underpin the contested ideal of sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c283b7bbdc3724574b4a465b7e4d29c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6efabe1598e6b04e35168d3c337aa67b</data>
