      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Systems modeling is viewed by some as a value-free process to generate information needed for sustainability, though the author argues it is value-laden."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-416c88a4653bbd08275b4ad4b3f6d0d9</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
