      <data key="d4">13.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Jamieson argues that conversations about sustainability are ineffective unless they move toward a substantive understanding of the concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jamieson is cited as part of a collective judgment that there is nothing novel or philosophically interesting about sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2b4618459cbb29170095bfe11ea386ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4b745ec575466c823b11b87211e1e2e</data>
