      <data key="d5">"Freyfogle is cited as part of a collective judgment that there is nothing novel or philosophically interesting about sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2b4618459cbb29170095bfe11ea386ab</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
