      <data key="d6">chunk-fac6f2d596c9d9fe2bc3b9afda4f10df</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;FERTILIZERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Fertilizers were a key component of the Green Revolution, though later precision farming reduced the amount used."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-59a4b4194753d7082d9b1d100574c96f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;HYBRIDS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Hybrids (wonder seeds) were central to the Green Revolution's goal of feeding growing populations."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-59a4b4194753d7082d9b1d100574c96f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;GPS SATELLITE EQUIPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"GPS satellite equipment is used by modern farmers to apply the inputs introduced during the Green Revolution with unprecedented precision."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-59a4b4194753d7082d9b1d100574c96f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;GULF OF MEXICO&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Green Revolution's agricultural practices contributed to water pollution and the creation of an annual dead zone in the Gulf of Mexico."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-59a4b4194753d7082d9b1d100574c96f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;SIR ALBERT HOWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text contrasts Sir Albert Howard's approach to agriculture with the technological-only limits of the Green Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c28ab0744bd2c8644bdc99e6c30ae80a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Green Revolution provided a significant boost to the industrialization of agriculture starting in the 1940s."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e6c384530d2705c862df0ec1ef11c2d3</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;COMMODITY AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Commodity production based on the tenets of the Green Revolution is described as being based on failed philosophical concepts."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2ab141b6aa8655dd452f4b60acea75bc</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BIOTECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Green Revolution and biotechnology breakthroughs both boosted crop yields and consolidated corporate control of the food system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b8f4ced19f39489760889dcf78f83b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;HABER-BOSCH PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Green Revolution utilized the cheap fertilizers produced by the Haber-Bosch process to double global crop production."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ef2473f4dcebdbdd42ecfa05be804a2d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;HOWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Howard's agricultural ideas were eclipsed by the fertilizer-intensive approach of the Green Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a3b1063c1d500ceacda94be5c1a920e</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;GREENLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Greenland's work addressed how the Green Revolution excluded traditional subsistence farmers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-05c72d9498345815172a428a41b0f62c</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BOA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Boa contrasts his methods with the Green Revolution approach of clearing fields to bare earth and applying fertilizers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5244a72295d4f84fc85246a4eb4df315</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONSERVATION AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Conservation agriculture is contrasted with the Green Revolution's practice of clearing land to bare earth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conservation agriculture is contrasted with the fertilizer-intensive, top-down practices of the Green Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0f57077126bc61f1a2588c34ca9614e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5244a72295d4f84fc85246a4eb4df315</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;NO-TILL&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The narrator and Boa compare no-till yields favorably against the yield increases associated with the Green Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6d827b4b169dc20f345800758c486eb4</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;DWAYNE BECK&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Dwayne Beck provides a colorful critique of the need for a 'brain transplant' regarding the conventional farming methods that followed the Green Revolution."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7ebf23631547617747b7c2b24e2249cf</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEN REVOLUTION&quot;" target="&quot;AMERICA&quot;">
