    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;WHITE CLOVER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Nitrogenous fertilisers can depress white clover, while white clover itself acts as a factory for the production of nitrogen."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7b0f6498b937320eef9f411ebf5a67c</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;RATIONAL GRAZING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The application of nitrogen dressings directly affects the possible livestock stocking rate within a rational grazing system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e8df78d16e962e8d1ecc294f9d88aaa9</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text uses examples from continental regions of Europe to calculate the amount of nitrogen needed to compensate for seasonal fluctuations in grass yield."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-205f09f7659de9588050e8fdc2bc1fb8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;PHOSPHO-POTASSIC FERTILISERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text compares the action of nitrogen, which is rapid and less persistent, to that of phospho-potassic fertilisers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-205f09f7659de9588050e8fdc2bc1fb8</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;DENITRIFICATION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Nitrogen is released into the air through the process of denitrification in manure heaps."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a3780f8195f7b351d288fda3cba325c0</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;" target="&quot;AMMONIA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Combined nitrogen escapes into the air in the form of ammonia gas."</data>
