    <edge source="&quot;ZÜRN&quot;" target="&quot;PHOSPHORIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Zürn conducted a study illustrating the influence of phosphoric acid on the vigour of grass growth and annual yield."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2bc3330d5a285f55c964c418de8061ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ZÜRN&quot;" target="&quot;POTASH&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Zürn conducted a study illustrating the influence of potash on the vigour of grass growth and annual yield."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2bc3330d5a285f55c964c418de8061ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ZÜRN&quot;" target="&quot;AMMONIA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Zürn's study examined the effects of nitrogenous fertilisers, which included ammonia."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2bc3330d5a285f55c964c418de8061ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ZÜRN&quot;" target="&quot;NITRATE OF LIME&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Zürn's study examined the effects of nitrogenous fertilisers, specifically including nitrate of lime."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2bc3330d5a285f55c964c418de8061ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ZÜRN&quot;" target="&quot;KALKAMMONSALPETER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Zürn's study utilized Kalkammonsalpeter as a nitrogenous fertiliser to measure grass growth vigour."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2bc3330d5a285f55c964c418de8061ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TRANSHUMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;RATIONAL GRAZING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Transhumance is described as a form of rational grazing (rotation on a grand scale) used to ensure necessary rest periods for grasslands in hot, dry regions."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9b968976fa1cf8fa9d4d1d922950ef30</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TRANSHUMANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SOUTHERN FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The herds in the hot dry regions of southern France have always practiced transhumance to move between plain and mountain pastures."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9b968976fa1cf8fa9d4d1d922950ef30</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LADY EVE BALFOUR&quot;" target="&quot;TEXAS RESEARCH FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Lady Eve Balfour visited the Texas Research Foundation to observe efforts to re-establish permanent pastures."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9b968976fa1cf8fa9d4d1d922950ef30</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
