      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Brundtland Report is cited as a foundational document that introduced the concept of sustainability, which is a core focus of environmentalism."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5add464238772f14d15e0e73bc4ad2f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BRUNDTLAND REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The report is discussed in the context of shaping thinking on sustainable development, which informs the author's discussion of agricultural sustainability in the U.S."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5c4efd6d2d98d5f75bdad4ee153609d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BRUNDTLAND REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;OUR COMMON FUTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">30.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"'Our Common Future' is the title of the Brundtland Report."&lt;SEP&gt;"Our Common Future is the report commonly known as the Brundtland Report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text explicitly directs the reader to see the Brundtland Report in relation to Our Common Future."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-d2e7bd65679a478d0454882e6ccaa48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec46d177c6336f2fe727e22398abaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aebdd45e025fa002441ab3f0054b695</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BRUNDTLAND REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;NORTH&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Brundtland Report shifts away from the North-South dichotomies found in the Brandt Report toward mutual interest."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-bec46d177c6336f2fe727e22398abaf6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BRUNDTLAND REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;GEORGE H. W. BUSH&quot;">
      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"George H.W. Bush used the phrase 'new world order', contrasting with the redistributive themes earlier implied in reports like Brundtland's context."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-bec46d177c6336f2fe727e22398abaf6</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
