      <data key="d5">"The Okies are the central subjects of Steinbeck's novel, The Grapes of Wrath."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okies are the itinerant protagonists in The Grapes of Wrath who confront the property-owning class."&lt;SEP&gt;"The novel portrays the struggles of the Okies, specifically regarding their transition to tenants."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aefcb893844980b6670c3646efbfb38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4464b8294896264256a3f3b6134be6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98e88e7751e5f203238d792144d7be41</data>
