      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Mark Sagoff is a widely read environmental philosopher whose views on community involve environmental ethics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mark Sagoff is an environmental philosopher whose views on community and value are central to his approach to environmental ethics."</data>
