      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Sagoff describes himself as a Kantian, basing his entire philosophical approach on doctrines established by Immanuel Kant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sagoff's philosophical approach to environmental issues relies on the doctrines established by Immanuel Kant."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c5a6f3cc859cd492c64d693f327d9c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52b953a69d1e5300dc42fea549624cc</data>
