      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Jefferson is cited as a historical example of the rural America that fits Inge's agrarian ideals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The author compares Inge's emphasis on rural autochthony with Jefferson's beliefs regarding the backbone of democracy."</data>
