      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Spirit of the Soil is a work that discusses agricultural efficiency and religious motives for crop production."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0b049f2bf4b4a3de219f4beff418722e</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE SPIRIT OF THE SOIL&quot;" target="&quot;LANSING DIOCESE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author uses the Lansing Diocese example to illustrate the systems orientation argument presented in the book 'The Spirit of the Soil'."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a94704d54ddaa6d4993efe825f7a171a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE SPIRIT OF THE SOIL&quot;" target="&quot;AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTION AND TRADE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author refers to the global system of agricultural production and trade as part of the complex systems analysis discussed in 'The Spirit of the Soil'."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a94704d54ddaa6d4993efe825f7a171a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
