      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"In 'The Spirit of the Soil', the author argues against simply incorporating traditional moral goals into the definition of sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0aa8cca9456a918d53e65d5b5d0a4333</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
