      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The agrarian vision serves as a generator of values for the vast majority of participants in the food system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
