      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The food system's issues with toxic chemicals are directly linked to the functioning of the agricultural system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FOOD SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;DOMESTIC CULINARY ARTS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author states that the food system's quality depends on the culture's commitment to and knowledge of the domestic culinary arts."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa91d64a86fa58173080c8817943c1c0</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FOOD SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRIAL FACTORIES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Industrial factories are described as fabricating artificial meals out of pseudo-food within the current food system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa91d64a86fa58173080c8817943c1c0</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FOOD SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Fast food is described as defining America's food landscape."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa91d64a86fa58173080c8817943c1c0</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STEWARDSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;AGRARIAN VISION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The agrarian vision promotes the virtue of stewardship for nature throughout society."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STEWARDSHIP&quot;" target="&quot;SELF-RELIANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Stewardship and self-reliance balance each other: stewardship checks self-reliance, while self-reliance prevents stewardship from becoming too convention-bound."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SELF-RELIANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AGRARIAN VISION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The agrarian vision helps people discover and develop the virtue of self-reliance."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOCIAL SOLIDARITY&quot;" target="&quot;AGRARIAN VISION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The agrarian vision promotes social solidarity due to the shared commitment of producers to their land."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRY&quot;" target="&quot;AGRARIAN VISION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The agrarian vision promotes the virtue of industry (simple hard work) through the visible link between work and reward."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7a53fa8bfd883994c6d2b9b2bb273da5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRY&quot;" target="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Agriculture provides a perpetual subsidy to industry, resulting in the impoverishment of large areas of the earth's surface."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f9a35a75b0bc3a557b68f4dc4d5219ba</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;AGRARIAN VISION&quot;" target="&quot;AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
