    <edge source="&quot;BORGMANN&quot;" target="&quot;REAL AMERICAN ETHICS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">30.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann is the author of 'Real American Ethics', where he discusses the 'culture of the table'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann is the author/philosopher whose theory of commodification is developed in the book Real American Ethics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real American Ethics is a book written by Borgmann where he introduces the 'culture of the table'."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7ec816632b945dc5236be5a3d82d9ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81158f16b3cf87e12a53465738040b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871f5c71b4e227c8d003d7cf1cbe8caf</data>
