      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann notes that citizens of socialist societies, like those in capitalist ones, feel trapped by the terms of technological production."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-871f5c71b4e227c8d003d7cf1cbe8caf</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BORGMANN&quot;" target="&quot;HEARTH&quot;">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann uses the hearth as a contrast to the central heating system to illustrate his concepts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann uses the hearth as an example of a 'focal thing' that centers and directs social practices."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-88e0f5242d77b26edc104b13880a55e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871f5c71b4e227c8d003d7cf1cbe8caf</data>
