      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann contrasts the central heating system with the hearth to illustrate the 'device paradigm' and commodification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borgmann contrasts the central heating system with the hearth to show the effects of technological alienation."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-88e0f5242d77b26edc104b13880a55e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-871f5c71b4e227c8d003d7cf1cbe8caf</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BORGMANN&quot;" target="&quot;DEVICE PARADIGM&quot;">
      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann's philosophy centers on the idea that life is emptied of meaning as it is taken over by the device paradigm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The device paradigm is a conceptual framework developed by Borgmann to explain how technology mediates the relationship between humans and nature."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-10cc72332e9d3a585995c00ff0c00c57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81158f16b3cf87e12a53465738040b4b</data>
