      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borgmann refers to the home architecture of Frank Lloyd Wright as an example of design that can resist moral commodification."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-81158f16b3cf87e12a53465738040b4b</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
