      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The hearth and central heating system are contrasted to demonstrate the bundling versus alienation of goods."&lt;SEP&gt;"These two technologies are contrasted by Borgmann to show the difference between a focal thing and a device that delivers a commodity."</data>
