      <data key="d4">13.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Both are mentioned as authors/thinkers who offer versions of the rural idyll."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hightower's political populism is presented as an alternative to Berry's more philosophical and moral agrarian ideals."</data>
