      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Husserl identifies Descartes as the one who further abstracted the Greek geometric conception of space via a three-dimensional algebraic system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b04d5012cc1525877c7e032e6701e281</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
