      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Thomas Hobbes is the author of the book Leviathan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thomas Hobbes wrote the influential book Leviathan, which outlines his view of civil society and the sovereign."</data>
