      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Bailey's vision of permanent agriculture aligns with the concept of resource sufficiency by ensuring soils are not consumed faster than they are built up."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b96ca94eb3fc51223443470c6a960c19</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
