      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Bennett's soil conservation work developed means to maintain resource sufficiency by augmenting soil formation and slowing consumption."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b96ca94eb3fc51223443470c6a960c19</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RESOURCE SUFFICIENCY&quot;" target="&quot;OGALALLA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Ogalalla aquifer is cited as an example of a nonrenewable resource that must be managed using resource sufficiency models to determine sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b96ca94eb3fc51223443470c6a960c19</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
