      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Lorenzo Lorraine Langstroth is the author of the book 'A Practical Treatise on the Hive and the Honey-Bee', in which he described the concept of bee space."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-d5ef06a37f825039b47c634db3e7dc6f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
