    <edge source="&quot;NATIONAL ORGANIC PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;USDA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The National Organic Program is a program of the USDA, and its standards and website are managed by the USDA."&lt;SEP&gt;"The USDA manages the implementation and standards of the National Organic Program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The USDA manages the organic logo and is linked to the NOP's establishment of honey standards."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ee9d755e2c9a36227961c7ffead7270e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac7e61f307eacb13980114b3ea5fb087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b464827b98fd832772a9e2806f166940</data>
