      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Both are federal initiatives under the USDA; the National Organic Program sets the standards that the Cost-Share Program helps farmers afford to meet."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac7e61f307eacb13980114b3ea5fb087</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
