    <edge source="&quot;ROTHAMSTED&quot;" target="&quot;MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Ministry of Agriculture bases its policy on the findings of Rothamsted to support the use of artificial manures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Agriculture is described as one of the disciples of Rothamsted, working together to deflect the march of organic farming."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-d49f5bc82b76d8f4146b18f3c7076cc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de45d40ec65e6186764314ff7c6c5c95</data>
