      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"George Clarke was a friend and former colleague of Sir Albert Howard whose research on soil fertility in Great Britain formed the basis of the book's fourth chapter."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f01a9018938914804f49a80182b2f205</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
