      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The form of the enclosure movement was influenced by the government structure that emerged following the English Revolution of 1688."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0abe6d6aad96f7bd4478403f4370b98d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
