      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Townshend's popularization of the turnip crop in 1730 followed the restoration of soil fertility resulting from enclosure."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0abe6d6aad96f7bd4478403f4370b98d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENGLISH REVOLUTION OF 1688&quot;" target="&quot;LANDED GENTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The English Revolution of 1688 led to the landed gentry becoming supreme in national and local administration."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0abe6d6aad96f7bd4478403f4370b98d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
