    <edge source="&quot;RAYMOND GRAM SWING&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Raymond Gram Swing broadcasted that the fertile soil of the United States would be severely depleted within fifty to one hundred years."</data>
