      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text links the depopulation of the Union of South Africa to a historical pattern of agricultural population decline seen in Greece and Rome."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-571b3fa101d4bb8e213e6691eda956ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
