      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The text contrasts agriculture with industrial economics, stating that agriculture is more fundamental and its field of regulation is still uncharted."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-571b3fa101d4bb8e213e6691eda956ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EUROPEAN FARMING&quot;" target="&quot;AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"European farming is presented as a specific instance of agriculture that has become exploitative by importing natural wealth from distant parts of the world."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-571b3fa101d4bb8e213e6691eda956ff</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
