      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The philosophy of the indigenous peoples regarding nature contrasts with the zero-tolerance mentality of the industrial model."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
