    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The industrial model of agriculture has influenced the beekeeping community to embrace toxic chemical treatments."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;VARROA DESTRUCTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The problems caused by Varroa destructor have inspired beekeepers to seek alternatives to the industrial model."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;US SCHOOLS OF AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"US schools of agriculture have promoted the industrial model's 'economy of scale' argument since the end of World War II."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;BRIAN HALWEIL&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Brian Halweil spells out the fallacy of applying the industrial model's 'grow larger' approach to farming."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;TRACTOR MAKERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Tractor makers are part of the industrial food system that captures most of the spending, leaving farmers with little profit."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;AGROCHEMICAL FIRMS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Agrochemical firms are dominant players in the industrial food industry that benefit from the shift away from farmer-led production."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INDUSTRIAL MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;SEED COMPANIES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Seed companies are dominant players in the industrial food industry that benefit from the shift away from farmer-led production."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-073a164302d7c27962522c12e811bf1d</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NATURE-BASED BEEKEEPING PHILOSOPHY&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A nature-based beekeeping philosophy offers a holistic alternative to the industrial model, emphasizing coexistence and tolerance."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7e8f2ee1522e3b4a6c4f7618a9db21e7</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
