      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Hans-Hinrich Kaatz conducted research demonstrating that patented GMO genes can survive in bees and jump species barriers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5ad48e636e32974fc2872c98d15a0914</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GMO&quot;" target="&quot;ORGANIC HONEY STANDARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The level of GMO contamination resulting from genetic engineering may make the establishment of organic honey standards a moot point."</data>
