      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Screened bottom boards are used as a tool to help control the population of varroa mites within the hive."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screened bottom boards are used to control and remove varroa mites from the hive by allowing them to fall through the screen."</data>
