      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Chesapeake Bay is located within the United States, used as an example of cumulative environmental degradation."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-cbe8805778c266769eb0b693963728ec</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE PUBLIC&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Beekeeping is presented as a gateway for individuals (the public) to reconnect with nature and break through illusory societal concepts."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE PUBLIC&quot;" target="&quot;THE MEDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The public and the media are grouped together as entities that must be informed about the global degradation of the biosphere."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE PUBLIC&quot;" target="&quot;THE COURTS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The public and the courts are identified as parties that must be informed and awaken to the reality of human impact on the planet."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;US ECONOMY&quot;" target="&quot;HEALTH CARE SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author claims the US economy cannot be fixed without radically changing the design and payment structure of the health care system."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;US ECONOMY&quot;" target="&quot;RENEWABLE ENERGY SOURCES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The author suggests transitioning to an economic system based on the equitable and efficient use of renewable energy sources to stop militarism."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-737fb05b56336a1f569d769f73394b31</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BLOWER SYSTEMS&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Blower systems are used by beekeepers with numerous hives to quickly remove bees from frames."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;REFRACTOMETER&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Beekeepers use a refractometer to measure moisture content to determine if honey is ripe for harvest."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EXTRACTING MACHINES&quot;" target="&quot;VARIABLE SPEED EXTRACTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A variable speed extractor is a specific type of extracting machine used to minimize damage to naturally built combs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
