      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Beekeepers use extracting machines to remove honey without destroying the wax combs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VARIABLE SPEED EXTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;BEEKEEPING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Beekeepers use a variable speed extractor to protect fragile, naturally built combs during extraction."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-749c6fdbfff886885761e25892c820c5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
