      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Both are methods used to remove debris from honey without heat, with settling tanks being preferred for larger volumes."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c3e5e906cf4b7199dbae90ca40e51e65</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORGANIC FOODS PRODUCTION ACT&quot;" target="&quot;NATIONAL ORGANIC STANDARDS BOARD&quot;">
      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The Organic Foods Production Act called for the creation of the National Organic Standards Board (NOSB)."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b464827b98fd832772a9e2806f166940</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
