      <data key="d4">12.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Isopropanol is used by the cultivator for sterilization when working in front of a laminar flow hood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isopropanol is used by the inoculator to wipe their hands while working at the table downstream from the laminar flow hood."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2c8c8ff82911884af1d7f6dd1d5a5310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-806d1be9aa2abcfd64cc0c7b7e5f0970</data>
