      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"In a multiroom laboratory, petri dish cultures are placed furthest upstream and given the highest priority in terms of location."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petri dish cultures are the highest priority and located furthest upstream within the laboratory environment."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a4d8ffd59b496178c8be531ac64f1a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36c513728ad8ea58b3b658cb85d90f8e</data>
