      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"In home-based setups, the kitchen is described as a primary breeding ground for contamination threatening the laboratory's integrity."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-03a51001a824f450f3fd025943f870fb</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LABORATORY&quot;" target="&quot;FRP&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"FRP (fiber reinforced plastic) is used to cover the walls and ceilings of the laboratory for cleanliness and durability."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-03a51001a824f450f3fd025943f870fb</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
