      <data key="d4">10.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"A positive-pressurized laboratory is a specific design implementation of a laboratory to keep contaminants out using filtered fresh air."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-03a51001a824f450f3fd025943f870fb</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LABORATORY&quot;" target="&quot;OYSTER MUSHROOMS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Over-incubated Oyster mushrooms can sporulate directly in the laboratory, threatening other cultures."</data>
