      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The spawn manager monitors the behavior of the mycelium, such as the fast growth of Morel mycelium, to gauge the success of a run."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-36c513728ad8ea58b3b658cb85d90f8e</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
