      <data key="d6">chunk-53f69fd7bda60518d54e55e7ff039d4c</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DENNIS&quot;" target="&quot;MOB GRAZING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Dennis practices high-density grazing (mob grazing), as evidenced by the way his cattle bunch up and move as a dense herd."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dennis utilizes mob grazing (high stocking density) to increase beef production per acre and improve soil carbon."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-53f69fd7bda60518d54e55e7ff039d4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a47444af0a2806843b6ade04b1af8e3</data>
