      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Mob grazing is contrasted with conventional grazing; while conventional may have better weight gain per cow, mob grazing has better total gain per acre."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-53f69fd7bda60518d54e55e7ff039d4c</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
