    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;CONCRETE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Cheap concrete allowed for scrapable, flushable surfaces, facilitating the beddingless systems necessary for CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;SLURRY PUMPS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Slurry pumps, along with other liquid manure handling equipment, provided the 'open door' to the implementation of CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;AUGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Augers are part of the liquid manure handling systems that replaced straw bedding, enabling CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;TRACTOR-MOUNTED SCRAPER BLADES&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Tractor-mounted scraper blades are part of the liquid manure handling systems that enabled CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;LIQUID MANURE SPREADERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Liquid manure spreaders are part of the liquid manure handling systems that enabled CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;CHEMICAL-BASED FERTILIZERS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"CAFOs remove carbon from farming, creating a deficit that is filled by energy-intensive chemical-based fertilizers."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;NORTH CAROLINA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"North Carolina has experienced fish kills due to overflowing manure lagoons associated with CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e87ed639576a22d712bb96c912bf3a58</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;RURAL ELECTRIFICATION&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Rural electrification provided the necessary infrastructure (electric motors for feedstuffs) that made CAFOs possible."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c55812c3e5f6a86b745576a3e44de86f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFOS&quot;" target="&quot;CAFO MONITORS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"CAFO monitors are sophisticated devices used to manage and oversee the environment and systems within CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c55812c3e5f6a86b745576a3e44de86f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFO&quot;" target="&quot;SLURRY SYSTEMS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"CAFOs prefer using slurry systems for manure management because hauling carbon for bedding is not economical."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ede091480c87d400703d007c513e150a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFO&quot;" target="&quot;MODERN INDUSTRIAL FARMING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"CAFOs are a product and primary example of modern industrial farming's focus on efficiency and cost reduction."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ede091480c87d400703d007c513e150a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAFO&quot;" target="&quot;CONCRETE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The increasing quality and decreasing cost of concrete were symbiotic with the development of CAFOs."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ede091480c87d400703d007c513e150a</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
